Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.08,0:00:02.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[soft music]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.64,0:00:05.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[birds chirping]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.64,0:00:05.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}《克拉克森的农场》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.20,0:00:08.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[cow mooing]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.20,0:00:12.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}第三十九集 病倒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.80,0:00:10.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[wind blowing softly]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.80,0:00:16.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[soft clattering]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.96,0:00:27.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[engine wheezing]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.60,0:00:30.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  The FarmDroid had now been set to work
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.60,0:00:33.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}播种机器人现在已经 重新开始播种洋葱和甜菜地了…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.20,0:00:33.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}replanting the onion and beetroot field.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.88,0:00:38.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But with the sky still stubbornly blue,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.88,0:00:38.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但天空依旧一片晴朗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.12,0:00:41.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I wasn't sure I could see the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.12,0:00:41.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不确定这样做有什么意义
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.12,0:00:44.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[soft clattering]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.12,0:00:44.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（播种机器人）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.52,0:00:51.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] So this planting is all very well,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.52,0:00:51.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 播种倒是进展顺利
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.08,0:00:53.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but pointless if it doesn't rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.08,0:00:53.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但不下雨就没用
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.00,0:00:53.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.00,0:00:53.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.52,0:00:56.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] So, it's reckoned
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.52,0:01:00.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}据估算 每公顷浇一万升水
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.72,0:01:00.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}ten thousand litres of water over a hectare
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.92,0:01:03.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}gives you the equivalent of one millimetre of rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.92,0:01:03.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}才相当于一毫米的降雨量
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.96,0:01:07.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And it's 24 millimetres
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.96,0:01:08.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而每周需要24毫米
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.32,0:01:09.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}you need every week.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.72,0:01:11.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[clattering continues]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.20,0:01:15.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You've never seen a James Bond film,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.20,0:01:15.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你从没看过《007》系列电影
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.08,0:01:17.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but I've never seen anyone as captivated...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.08,0:01:17.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但我从没见过任何人像你那样…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.92,0:01:20.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Kaleb] It's fascinating. -...as you are by that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.92,0:01:20.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-这太迷人了 -…被那个东西迷住的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.76,0:01:22.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Could you not just watch that all day? -No...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.76,0:01:22.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你难道不能就这么看一整天吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.88,0:01:26.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean, yeah, five minutes and... But you... Look at his face!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.88,0:01:25.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 我是说 能 看五分钟还行…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.28,0:01:27.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但你…看他那张脸！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.20,0:01:30.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's really... [chuckling]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.20,0:01:30.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}真的…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.00,0:01:33.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-You love that machine, don't you? -Yeah, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.00,0:01:33.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-你喜欢那台机器 对吧？ -对 我喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.44,0:01:37.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What gets me is it put 200,000 seeds in yesterday
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.44,0:01:37.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}让我惊讶的是 它昨天播了二十万颗种子
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.20,0:01:40.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and it knows where every single one of them is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.20,0:01:40.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而且知道每一颗在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.36,0:01:41.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-That's unbelievable. -So,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.36,0:01:41.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这太不可思议了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.52,0:01:45.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}when it's finished doing this, OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.52,0:01:45.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 等它干完这个 好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.08,0:01:51.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh no, I've lost him again. He's gone back to his CornHub.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.08,0:01:48.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 我又…他又走神了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.84,0:01:51.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-他又回去看他的“玉米情色网”了 -有种感觉…它有种感觉…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.60,0:01:54.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[chuckling] CornHub! -CornHub, that's what he's watching!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.60,0:01:54.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-他的“玉米情色网”？ -“玉米情色网” 他就在看那个
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.76,0:01:57.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[soft music]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.60,0:02:01.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  Since there was nothing we could do about the lack of rain,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.60,0:02:01.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}既然我们对干旱无能为力
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.72,0:02:03.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we got on with other jobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.72,0:02:03.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们就去干别的活了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.36,0:02:11.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Kaleb started mowing and baling the grassland
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.36,0:02:13.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}卡莱布开始割草地、打捆 做青贮饲料
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.40,0:02:13.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to make silage.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.56,0:02:15.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Eighteen bales so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.56,0:02:15.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}到目前为止有18捆
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.64,0:02:19.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}More food for the cows throughout the winter months.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.64,0:02:19.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}为牛群过冬准备更多饲料
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.24,0:02:25.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  Then it was time to move the EasyCare sheep and their lambs
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.24,0:02:25.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后该把易养羊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.12,0:02:27.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to a new pasture.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.12,0:02:27.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}和它们的羊羔转移到新牧场了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.48,0:02:29.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Jez] How are you doing, Jeremy? -Hi, Jez.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.48,0:02:29.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-你好吗 杰里米？ -嗨 杰兹
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.80,0:02:31.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Jez] You well? -Yeah, good to see you . How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.80,0:02:31.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-你还好吗？ -嗯 很高兴见到你 你好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.48,0:02:35.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  And to help us, our sheep-farming neighbours had come round.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.48,0:02:35.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}来帮忙的是我们养羊的邻居…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.24,0:02:37.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You tell me where you want me, Jeremy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.24,0:02:37.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你告诉我需要我站在哪儿 杰里米
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.16,0:02:39.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Not that Jeremy. The one that knows what he's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.16,0:02:39.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不是那个杰里米 是那个知道自己该干什么的杰里米
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.56,0:02:44.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  Which meant we had the treat of watching their sheepdog at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.56,0:02:44.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…所以我们有幸 看到他们工作状态的牧羊犬
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.80,0:02:46.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[woman shepherd] Stand! Stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.80,0:02:46.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}稳住！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.76,0:02:48.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Here they come.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.76,0:02:48.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们来了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.72,0:02:50.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[epic rock music]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.36,0:02:53.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look, here's the dog! Look, the dog's doing it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.36,0:02:53.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你看 狗在那儿！你看 狗在赶羊！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.96,0:02:55.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look at the dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.96,0:02:55.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你看那条狗！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.40,0:02:57.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I just love watching sheepdogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.40,0:02:57.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我就是喜欢看牧羊犬
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.20,0:03:00.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[woman shepherd] Midge! Stand! Stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.20,0:03:00.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}米奇！稳住！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.56,0:03:01.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Midge, stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.56,0:03:02.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}米奇 稳住！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.96,0:03:02.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.88,0:03:04.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Midge! Stand! That'll do. That'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.88,0:03:04.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}米奇！稳住！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.60,0:03:07.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Jeremy] Wow! -[woman shepherd] Midge, that'll do!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.60,0:03:07.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}行了 可以了 米奇 行了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.16,0:03:10.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Stand. Stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.16,0:03:10.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}稳住！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.80,0:03:12.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] And the sheep are now corralled.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.80,0:03:12.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在羊被圈起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.36,0:03:15.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[sheep bleating]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.48,0:03:18.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] They look stonking little lambs, though, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.48,0:03:18.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这些小羊羔长得真不错 是吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.44,0:03:20.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jez] Oh the best, I have, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.44,0:03:20.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我印象很深 真的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.60,0:03:22.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] I can't believe...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.60,0:03:22.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}真不敢相信…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.08,0:03:23.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You're a committed sheep farmer
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.08,0:03:26.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你是个养羊的老手 之前从没养过易养羊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.96,0:03:26.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}who's never had EasyCare before
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.20,0:03:27.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and you always hated sheep
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.20,0:03:29.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而你之前一直讨厌羊 结果你们俩都说
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.88,0:03:29.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and both of you are going:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.48,0:03:31.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"Well, why don't we all have EasyCare?"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.48,0:03:31.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“我们为什么不都养易养羊呢？”
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.76,0:03:33.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It was a good decision you made here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.76,0:03:33.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你这个决定做得不错
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.04,0:03:34.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[scoffing] I wish it was... -[Kaleb] Bloody hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.04,0:03:34.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-我真希望是…对 -天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.04,0:03:36.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-You wish it was your decision? -[Jeremy] No, it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.04,0:03:36.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}希望什么？希望是你做的决定？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.88,0:03:39.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Do you know, it was... [whispering]  Countryfile.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.88,0:03:39.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 是…你知道吗 是《乡村档案》节目的决定
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.32,0:03:41.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, fuck me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.32,0:03:41.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我操！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.76,0:03:43.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[woman shepherd] Up! Up! -[Jeremy] Go on, in you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.76,0:03:42.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}上去！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.80,0:03:43.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}走吧 进去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.96,0:03:45.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  Having loaded them into the trailer...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.96,0:03:45.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}把它们装进拖车后…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.08,0:03:46.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[bleating]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.12,0:03:48.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Baaa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.52,0:03:51.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  ...we took them to their new field
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.52,0:03:51.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们带它们去了新田地
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.32,0:03:54.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which the government had made us fill with eco plants
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.32,0:03:54.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}政府让我们在那块地里种满了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.72,0:03:57.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}that humans can't eat, but sheep can.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.72,0:03:58.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}人类不能吃 但羊能吃的环保植物
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.92,0:03:59.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[soft music]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.88,0:04:02.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Come on, lambas!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.88,0:04:02.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}来吧 羊羔们！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.08,0:04:05.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[chuckling]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.60,0:04:07.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Come on! -[Lisa] Oh my God, that is glorious!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.60,0:04:07.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}来吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.32,0:04:09.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.32,0:04:09.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-天哪 太漂亮了！ -我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.68,0:04:12.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look at this! They've never seen grass this long.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.68,0:04:12.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你看 它们从没见过这么长的草
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.68,0:04:15.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Lisa] That is amazing. So lush. -[Jeremy] Unbelievable, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.68,0:04:14.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.08,0:04:15.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-难以置信 是吧？ -这么茂盛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.60,0:04:16.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What a sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.60,0:04:16.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}真是个好景象
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.00,0:04:18.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[bleating]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.80,0:04:23.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They're gonna be the size of Zeppelins those sheep.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.80,0:04:23.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那些羊会长成齐柏林飞艇那么大
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.12,0:04:25.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What's a Zeppelin? Like a zebra?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.12,0:04:25.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}齐柏林飞艇是什么？像斑马吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.44,0:04:26.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy chuckling]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.00,0:04:28.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Fuck off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.00,0:04:29.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-滚蛋 -你知道齐柏林飞艇是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.00,0:04:29.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You know what a Zeppelin is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.76,0:04:32.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, it's an ant... it's a... it's a an... it's an antelope.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.76,0:04:32.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是羚…是羚…是一种羚羊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.40,0:04:34.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[scoffing]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.28,0:04:39.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  With the sheeps happily grazing away,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.28,0:04:39.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在羊群开心地吃草时
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.52,0:04:43.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I set off with Diddly Squat's resident zoologist
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.52,0:04:43.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我和迪丽斯库阿特的常驻动物学家
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.36,0:04:45.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}back to the yard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.36,0:04:45.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}出发回院子了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.32,0:04:47.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What I'm gonna do is just check my mirrors before reversing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.32,0:04:47.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我要做的就是倒车前先看看后视镜
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.88,0:04:50.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I find, I don't know, it kinda helps.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.88,0:04:50.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得…我说不上来 就是有点用
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.88,0:04:53.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If somebody's parked their car behind you,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.88,0:04:53.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果有人把车停在你后面
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.48,0:04:55.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}you just have a look in the mirrors, just check it out
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.48,0:04:55.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你就看看后视镜 看一眼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.84,0:04:57.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and make sure there's nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.84,0:04:57.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}确保没有什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.32,0:04:59.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-I'm never gonna live this down, am I? -No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.32,0:04:59.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那事 我一辈子翻不了篇了 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.12,0:05:00.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.20,0:05:02.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  No, he wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.20,0:05:04.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}翻不了篇了 因为前一天
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.20,0:05:03.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Because the day before,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.88,0:05:09.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Kaleb had given me the absolute best of sticks
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.88,0:05:10.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}卡莱布给了我一个绝佳的把柄
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.24,0:05:10.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to beat him with.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.28,0:05:13.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[no audio]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.20,0:05:17.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] Bad job, innit?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.20,0:05:17.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}干得真差劲 是吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.60,0:05:20.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-That's the producer's Land Rover. -[Kaleb] I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.60,0:05:20.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-那是制片人的路虎 -我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.80,0:05:23.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] I wonder how its windscreen's got broken and all the front smashed up?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.80,0:05:23.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它的挡风玻璃怎么碎了 整个车头都撞烂了？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.44,0:05:25.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It must have been a pheasant.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.44,0:05:25.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}肯定是野鸡干的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.32,0:05:27.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Must've been a pheasant.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.32,0:05:27.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}肯定是野鸡干的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.48,0:05:31.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Lisa] Is this you too? -[Jeremy] He's done everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.48,0:05:31.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-这也是你干的？ -全都是他干的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.04,0:05:33.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-How? -I was baling, it was parked over there,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.04,0:05:33.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-怎么弄的？ -我在打捆 它停在那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.68,0:05:34.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}didn't see it in the mirror
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.68,0:05:34.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我没在后视镜里看到 它之前不在那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.92,0:05:36.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}'cause it wasn't there beforehand and then reversed into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.92,0:05:36.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-然后我倒车撞上了 -我之前倒车撞进谷仓的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.68,0:05:39.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But when I reversed into the barn, you were really cross with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.68,0:05:40.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-你对我可凶了 -对 那当然
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.44,0:05:40.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, yeah, obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.08,0:05:42.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look, there's that barn over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.08,0:05:42.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-你看 那边那个谷仓 -对
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.80,0:05:44.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You've done that barn over there. You've done the barn over there
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.80,0:05:44.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你撞了那边那个谷仓 那边那个谷仓
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.96,0:05:46.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and the gale break on the right-hand side.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.96,0:05:46.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}右边的挡风网
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.56,0:05:47.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] I didn't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.56,0:05:47.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-也撞弯了 -那不是我干的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.36,0:05:51.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Basically, I employ Kaleb Cooper Contracting
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.36,0:05:51.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}说白了 就是我雇了 卡莱布库珀承包团队来农场
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.36,0:05:53.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}who come round to the farm and smash everything up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.36,0:05:53.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后把一切都砸了个稀巴烂
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.28,0:05:55.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] You talk so much shit, it's unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.28,0:05:55.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你满嘴跑火车 真是难以置信
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.36,0:05:58.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's so much fun catching him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.36,0:05:58.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}抓住他的把柄太有意思了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.56,0:06:03.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}["Love Reign O'er Me" by The Who playing]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.84,0:06:05.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  A few days later,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.84,0:06:05.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}几天后
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.56,0:06:10.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}a June morning arrived bearing gifts.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.56,0:06:10.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}六月的一个早晨带来了礼物
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.84,0:06:13.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ Only love ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.84,0:06:16.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}唯有爱能带来雨
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.24,0:06:15.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ Can bring the rain ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.32,0:06:19.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ That falls like tears ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.32,0:06:19.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如泪般洒落
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.68,0:06:23.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ From on high ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.68,0:06:23.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}从天而降
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.60,0:06:25.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ Love ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.60,0:06:25.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}爱
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.20,0:06:31.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ Reign o'er me ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.20,0:06:31.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}主宰我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.76,0:06:37.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ Rain on me ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.76,0:06:37.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}雨落在我身
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.00,0:06:42.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ I can't sleep and I lay and I think ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.00,0:06:42.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我无法入睡 我躺着 我在想
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.24,0:06:44.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ The night is hot and black as ink ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.24,0:06:44.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}黑夜炽热 漆黑如墨
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.84,0:06:49.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[through the phone]  ♪ Oh God, I need a drink of cool, cool rain ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.84,0:06:49.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天哪 我需要喝一口清凉的雨水
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.92,0:06:51.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"Cool, cool rain"!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.92,0:06:51.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“清凉的雨水”
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.44,0:06:53.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[music continues on Jeremy's phone]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.96,0:06:56.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] That's what we got now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.96,0:06:56.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就是我们现在的状态
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.72,0:06:59.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Cool, cool rain!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.72,0:06:59.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“清凉的雨水！”
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.08,0:07:01.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] It feels good, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.08,0:07:01.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}感觉很好 是吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.72,0:07:03.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  And to keep our spirits up,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.72,0:07:03.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}为了保持我们的士气
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.56,0:07:07.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we decided to release Endgame back into the fields
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.56,0:07:07.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们决定把终局放回田里
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.28,0:07:09.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to join the rest of the herd.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.28,0:07:09.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}和牛群其他成员会合
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.60,0:07:10.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[mooing]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.52,0:07:14.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Endgame, give us a hand. -[Kaleb panting]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.52,0:07:14.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}终局 帮把手
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.28,0:07:15.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Kaleb] Yeah, push, buddy. -Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.28,0:07:16.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-对 用力 兄弟 用力 -好！加油！你能行！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.76,0:07:17.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Kaleb] Push! -You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.68,0:07:24.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[mooing loudly] -[Kaleb] Go on, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.68,0:07:24.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}走吧 兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.64,0:07:28.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Jeremy whispering] Look at him. -Looks fucking good. Watch out...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.64,0:07:28.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}真他妈好！小心
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.32,0:07:29.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}He looks smart, doesn't he? He's done well over the winter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.32,0:07:29.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它看起来很帅 是吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.72,0:07:31.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.72,0:07:31.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-它这个冬天过得不赖 -对
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.04,0:07:37.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Mate, I have to say, we are fucking good at our jobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.04,0:07:37.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}老兄 我得说 我们真擅长干这行
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.84,0:07:40.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If there are prizes
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.84,0:07:40.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我…要是把公牛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.44,0:07:42.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}for loading a bull into a trailer,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.44,0:07:42.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}装进拖车也有比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.96,0:07:45.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I think we've just won gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.96,0:07:45.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得我们刚拿了金牌
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.08,0:07:49.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}He's still the best animal on the farm by a country mile.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.08,0:07:49.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它依然是这个农场里 最棒的动物 远超其他
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.64,0:07:51.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You can keep Richard Ham,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.64,0:07:51.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你可以留着理查德汉姆 你可以留着一切
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.68,0:07:54.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}you can keep everything: he's just tremendous.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.68,0:07:54.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我…它就是太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.08,0:07:57.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[rock music]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.04,0:08:03.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Hey! I'm gonna do something I haven't done for months. Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.04,0:08:00.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}嘿！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.48,0:08:03.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我要做一件好几个月没做过的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.32,0:08:04.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.32,0:08:04.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-准备好了？ -什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.04,0:08:07.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Windscreen wipers. I forgot what they were for.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.04,0:08:08.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}雨刷 我都忘了它们是干吗用的了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.76,0:08:08.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.56,0:08:10.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[cows mooing]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.12,0:08:13.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[rock music continues]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.32,0:08:21.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hey, kids, daddy's home!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.32,0:08:21.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}嘿 孩子们 爸爸回来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.80,0:08:28.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There's palpable excitement from these cows and calves.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.80,0:08:27.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-这些牛和小牛们… -准备好了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.64,0:08:28.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…显然很兴奋
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.96,0:08:29.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Kaleb] Ready? -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.96,0:08:29.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-准备好了吗？ -好了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.04,0:08:34.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.04,0:08:34.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你们好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.40,0:08:36.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[cows mooing loudly]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.40,0:08:39.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb chuckling]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.96,0:08:44.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, look at him. He's just beside himself, running with his kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.96,0:08:44.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你看它 它都高兴坏了 和它的孩子们一起奔跑
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.20,0:08:48.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] I love it when a calf's tail goes up in the air, like "I am fast."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.20,0:08:48.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我喜欢小牛尾巴翘起来的样子 就像在说：“我可快了”
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.04,0:08:50.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's like a spoiler.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.04,0:08:50.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就像个尾翼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.80,0:08:55.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Erm... [Kaleb chuckling]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.72,0:08:57.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Fucking hell...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.72,0:08:57.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我操
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.32,0:09:00.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You know we've been ringed here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.32,0:09:00.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你知道我们被包围了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.88,0:09:01.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] Hey?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.88,0:09:03.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-嘿！ -它们就在围着我们跑
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.88,0:09:04.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-They're just running round. -[Kaleb laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.64,0:09:09.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And there they go, sheltering from the rain in the trees!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.64,0:09:09.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们跑了 到树下躲雨去了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.20,0:09:13.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What a happy day: it's raining,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.20,0:09:13.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}多么快乐的一天啊 下雨了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.12,0:09:15.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-and look how happy Endgame is. -[Kaleb] Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.12,0:09:15.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-你看终局多开心 -对！对
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.48,0:09:17.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[soft orchestral music]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.48,0:09:22.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  We prayed the rain would continue,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.48,0:09:22.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们祈祷雨能继续下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.28,0:09:23.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but the next day...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.28,0:09:23.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但第二天…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.40,0:09:28.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}normal service was resumed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.40,0:09:28.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一切又恢复了原样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.48,0:09:33.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And because there was still nothing I could do about that,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.48,0:09:33.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}既然我对这事还是无能为力
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.60,0:09:37.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I decided to busy myself with a distraction,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.60,0:09:37.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我决定找点别的事忙活一下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.24,0:09:41.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}a pet project I'd wanted to do for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.24,0:09:41.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一个我想了好多年的特别看重的项目
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.48,0:09:44.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}One of the things that's depressed me a little bit
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.48,0:09:44.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}自从开始干这档子农活以来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.36,0:09:46.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}since I started this farming malarkey is,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.36,0:09:49.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}有件事一直让我有点沮丧 就是在农场走来走去时
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.84,0:09:48.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}as you walk around the place,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.12,0:09:50.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}you see quite a few songbirds,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.12,0:09:50.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你能看到不少鸣禽
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.88,0:09:54.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}you know, yellowhammers and goldfinches and sparrows and so on, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.88,0:09:54.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}比如黄鹀、金翅雀 麻雀等等 但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.72,0:09:57.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}you don't very often see
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.72,0:10:01.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你很少能看到那种传统农田鸟类
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.92,0:10:01.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}any traditional farmland birds.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.24,0:10:04.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And I was talking about this the other day to a girl in the next village
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.24,0:10:04.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}前几天我和邻村的一个女孩聊起这事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.40,0:10:08.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}who is a very keen birdwatcher.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.40,0:10:08.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}她是个非常狂热的观鸟爱好者
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.68,0:10:10.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And she said: "OK, well, look, I'll come round
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.68,0:10:12.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}她说：“好吧 那我过来看看 我们瞧瞧到底怎么回事”
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.36,0:10:12.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and let's see what's going on."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.68,0:10:16.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The problem with birdwatchers, though, is that, erm,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.68,0:10:17.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不过观鸟的人有个问题 他们就像军队一样
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.16,0:10:17.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}they're like the army:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.36,0:10:20.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}they never want to meet you at about eleven.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.36,0:10:20.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们从来不会说“差不多11点见”
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.56,0:10:23.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}or "let's have a spot of lunch and then get cracking".
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.56,0:10:23.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}或者“吃个午饭再开始”
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.28,0:10:26.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's always: "Right, I'll see you at o'crickey o'clock."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.28,0:10:26.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们总是说：“好 凌晨几点见”
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.52,0:10:29.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[soft orchestral music]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.24,0:10:33.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  And so, at 4 a.m., I met the birdwatcher, Hannah,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.24,0:10:33.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}于是 凌晨四点 我去见了那个观鸟者 汉娜
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.80,0:10:39.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}who was already excited having heard a bustle in the hedgerow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.80,0:10:39.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}她听到树篱里有动静 已经兴奋起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.52,0:10:44.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I know loads of people across the country come to Diddly Squat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.52,0:10:44.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道全国各地 有很多人来迪丽斯库阿特
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.08,0:10:48.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But this guy has travelled eight thousand miles
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.08,0:10:48.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但这位可是飞了一万两千多公里
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.20,0:10:50.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to get here to this thicket.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.20,0:10:50.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}才来到这里 这片灌木丛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.12,0:10:51.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-And hope... -[Jeremy] What is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.12,0:10:51.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-希望… -它是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.32,0:10:54.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}A Garden Warbler. Oooh...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.32,0:10:54.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一只庭园林莺
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.76,0:10:57.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Birders get really crazy about Warblers
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.76,0:10:57.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}观鸟的人对林莺特别痴迷 因为它们太漂亮了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.24,0:10:59.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because they're so pretty. They kind of sound like Mariah Carey on fast-forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.24,0:10:59.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们叫起来有点像快进版玛丽亚凯莉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.08,0:11:00.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[birds chirping]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.12,0:11:02.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] A Garden Warbler?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.12,0:11:02.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一只庭园林莺？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.60,0:11:04.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Hannah] From South Africa. -South Africa?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.60,0:11:04.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-从南非来的 -南非？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.44,0:11:05.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. And he'll come back next year.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.44,0:11:06.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-对 它明年还会回来 -它是不是只有那么大？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.96,0:11:06.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Isn't he about that big?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.96,0:11:09.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh yeah, they're really small, and they're dull,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.96,0:11:09.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们真的特别小 看起来也不起眼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.32,0:11:10.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but they sound really cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.32,0:11:10.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但叫声特别好听
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.80,0:11:14.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There's also a Blackcap, another Warbler.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.80,0:11:14.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}还有一只黑顶林莺 也是林莺的一种
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.36,0:11:16.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What's this? Is this your list of things you've heard?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.36,0:11:16.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是什么？ 这是你听到的鸟的清单吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.64,0:11:18.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. Oh, that's a Wren.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.64,0:11:18.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 这是鹪鹩
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.40,0:11:21.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Like a pneumatic machine gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.40,0:11:21.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}叫起来像气动机关枪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.32,0:11:22.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}From what I can gather so far, this isn't birdwatching,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.32,0:11:22.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}据我目前观察
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.72,0:11:25.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}this is bird listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.72,0:11:25.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这不是观鸟 这是听鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.32,0:11:27.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, this is a singing survey.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.32,0:11:27.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 这叫鸣鸟调查
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.32,0:11:28.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's not its technical name.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.32,0:11:28.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那不是专业叫法
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.00,0:11:32.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I know, though. Ah! My Merlin bird app.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.00,0:11:30.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-但没错 -我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.40,0:11:32.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我的梅林鸟类识别软件
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.52,0:11:35.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Let's go over there because the Garden Warblers hang out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.52,0:11:35.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们去那边吧 庭园林莺待在那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.84,0:11:39.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[phone buzzing] -[Jeremy whispering] That bird...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.84,0:11:39.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在找那只鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.32,0:11:41.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}that's a Skylark.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.32,0:11:41.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那是云雀 当它变黄的时候…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.48,0:11:43.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}When it goes yellow that's 'cause it's heard that bird at that precise moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.48,0:11:43.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（欧亚云雀）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.00,0:11:46.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's what it's said so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.00,0:11:45.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…因为就是那一刻 它听到了那只鸟的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.40,0:11:46.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是它到目前为止听到的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.32,0:11:48.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[whispering] It's this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.32,0:11:48.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就是这只
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.76,0:11:50.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[birds chirping] -[phone buzzing]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.76,0:11:50.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（庭园林莺）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.04,0:11:52.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy whispering] There, Garden Warbler, she was right!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.04,0:11:52.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那儿！庭园林莺！她说对了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.44,0:11:55.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}She doesn't even have the app.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.44,0:11:55.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}她连这软件都没用
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.68,0:11:58.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And so I'd love... I've always said I want to get that...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.68,0:11:58.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我一直很想…我一直都说我想弄那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.84,0:12:00.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Hannah] Oh! Listen, listen, listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.84,0:12:02.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你听！你能听到 载重汽车倒车的声音吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.36,0:12:02.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Can you hear the lorry reversing? -[birds chirping]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.08,0:12:06.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's a bird, but it sounds like a lorry reversing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.08,0:12:06.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}二…那是一只鸟 但听起来像载重汽车倒车的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.56,0:12:08.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[birds chirping] -[bird croaking]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.00,0:12:10.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Jeremy] That? -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.00,0:12:10.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-那个？ -对
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.40,0:12:11.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's a Greater Whitethroat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.40,0:12:11.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那是白喉林莺
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.68,0:12:14.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[phone buzzing] -Oh, Greater Whitethroat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.68,0:12:14.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“白喉林莺”
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.08,0:12:16.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[chuckling] Greater Whitethroat!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.08,0:12:15.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（白喉林莺）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.24,0:12:16.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“白喉林莺！”
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.96,0:12:20.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Hannah: faster than the Merlin bird app. -[Hannah chuckling]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.96,0:12:20.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}汉娜 比梅林鸟类识别软件还快
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.16,0:12:24.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Do you do it when you're just walking along and you're constantly tuned into?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.16,0:12:24.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你走在路上也这样吗 一直保持着那个状态…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.68,0:12:26.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Hannah] Oh, look, Skylarks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.68,0:12:26.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你看 云雀
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.28,0:12:27.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[phone buzzing] -Erm...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.28,0:12:27.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（欧亚云雀）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.60,0:12:29.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Well, I can't see any.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.60,0:12:29.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我一只也看不见
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.52,0:12:31.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How did you learn to do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.52,0:12:31.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你怎么学会这个的？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.68,0:12:35.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Erm, I spent a long time living on my own in the bush in Africa
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.68,0:12:35.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我以前在非洲的灌木丛里 一个人住了很长时间
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.64,0:12:37.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}where I had no friends and I had a bird in my hair,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.64,0:12:37.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在那儿 我没朋友 头发里住过一只鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.76,0:12:40.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-and I just tuned into all the birds, so. -You had what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.76,0:12:40.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-我就开始专注听各种鸟的声音… -你什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.76,0:12:42.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Erm, I just tuned into the birds because...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.76,0:12:42.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我开始专注听各种鸟的声音 因为…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.00,0:12:45.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-No, you had a bird in your hair. -I had a bird in my hair, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.00,0:12:45.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-不 你头发里住过一只鸟？ -头发里有只鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.24,0:12:48.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I found a little nestling bird
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.24,0:12:48.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我发现了一只小小鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.48,0:12:50.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and his nest had been blown down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.48,0:12:50.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它的巢被风吹掉了 整个鸟群都抛弃了它
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.80,0:12:53.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}His whole flock had abandoned him, he would have died otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.80,0:12:54.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不然它会死的 所以我想：“行吧”
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.56,0:12:54.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So I thought, OK, fine,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.52,0:12:57.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'll try and be surrogate mother to this tiny little Finch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.52,0:12:57.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我来试着当这只小雀鸟的养母
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.84,0:13:00.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And it worked, but it meant that I was his whole world
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.84,0:13:00.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它确实活下来了 但这也意味着我成了它的整个世界
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.92,0:13:04.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and so he lived on my body for all of his time awake,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.92,0:13:04.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它醒着的时候都待在我身上
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.88,0:13:06.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and when he went to sleep and napped
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.88,0:13:08.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}睡觉的时候就用我的头发 给自己搭个小窝
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.48,0:13:08.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}he would make little nests out of my hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.44,0:13:10.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And this went on for three months.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.44,0:13:10.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就这样过了三个月
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.56,0:13:13.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[laughing] So I hung out with this little bird in my hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.56,0:13:13.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以那段时间 我头发里一直住着这只小鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.76,0:13:15.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What happened to it in the end, then? Did he just fly away?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.76,0:13:15.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那后来呢？它飞走了？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.76,0:13:18.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, well, I reintegrated him into his flock
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.76,0:13:18.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没有 我让它重新融入鸟群
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.72,0:13:20.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}by stalking his family every day for twelve hours for two months with him,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.72,0:13:20.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我跟踪了它的家族…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.72,0:13:24.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}so that he learnt how to be a wild finch.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.72,0:13:22.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}连着两个月 每天12个小时都带着它
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.72,0:13:24.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}让它学会怎么当一只野生雀鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.40,0:13:27.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And in that time I had to tune into all the landscape sounds
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.40,0:13:27.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那段时间 我必须 熟悉所有环境中的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.32,0:13:29.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because a lot of them were predatory sounds that would have killed him
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.32,0:13:29.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为很多声音是捕食者发出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.84,0:13:32.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and also snakes and things that would have killed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.84,0:13:32.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那会要了它的命 还有蛇之类的东西 也会要了我的命
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.72,0:13:36.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And so I learnt all the sounds and I got addicted.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.72,0:13:34.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我就学会了所有的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.64,0:13:36.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后就上瘾了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.92,0:13:42.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  I then explained why I needed her expertise.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.92,0:13:42.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}接着我跟她解释了 我为什么需要她的专业意见
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.64,0:13:45.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[softly] I don't think we're badly off for songbirds here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.64,0:13:45.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得我们这儿鸣禽不算少
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.56,0:13:47.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-You see quite a few. -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.56,0:13:47.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-你确实能看到不少 -对
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.24,0:13:48.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[softly] It's farmland birds. -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.24,0:13:48.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我说的是农田鸟类
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.76,0:13:53.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So I'm super interested in the farmland birds that are here all year
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.76,0:13:51.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 所以我特别感兴趣的是 那些常年待在这儿的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.96,0:13:53.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}农田鸟类
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.40,0:13:55.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and that's why I wanna go and have a look at that hedge.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.40,0:13:55.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这就是为什么我想去看看那边的树篱
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.28,0:13:59.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] What would you call "farmland" birds?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.28,0:13:59.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你说的“农田鸟类”是指哪些？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.64,0:14:02.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Lapwings and Curlews, obviously, but what else?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.64,0:14:02.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}显然有凤头麦鸡和杓鹬 还有别的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.68,0:14:05.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Hanna] Skylarks, Linnets, Corn Buntings, Yellowhammers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.68,0:14:05.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}云雀、朱顶雀、黍鹀、黄鹀
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.88,0:14:07.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And how many of them are endangered?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.88,0:14:07.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那它们当中有多少是濒危品种？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.04,0:14:11.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, there are thirteen on the red list right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.04,0:14:11.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在红色名录上有13种
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.24,0:14:13.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Out of six... -Out of, like, twenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.24,0:14:13.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-总共60多种？ -总共大概20种
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.00,0:14:16.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So, I mean, most of them are on the red list.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.00,0:14:16.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 我的意思是 大部分…大部分都在红色名录上
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.56,0:14:19.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And it's not just that they're endangered: they're massively.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.56,0:14:19.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而且不只是濒危 是数量锐减
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.60,0:14:22.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So Turtle Dove: 99% of its population gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.60,0:14:22.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就拿斑鸠来说 百分之九十九的种群都没了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.32,0:14:24.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Oh yeah. -Grey Partridge: 92%.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.32,0:14:24.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-天呐 -灰山鹑 百分之九十二
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.84,0:14:26.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And the point is, the reason why they're on the red list,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.84,0:14:26.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}问题是 它们上红色名录的原因
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.92,0:14:31.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}is because of the change in farming practices, the intensification,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.92,0:14:31.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是农业耕作方式的改变、集约化
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.48,0:14:36.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}118,000 miles of hedge that has gone in the last seventy years.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.48,0:14:34.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}还有过去七十年里
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.12,0:14:36.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}消失的19万公里树篱
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.44,0:14:40.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They are starving to death in the winter because there isn't enough natural food.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.44,0:14:40.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们冬天会饿死 因为没有足够的天然食物
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.44,0:14:42.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But I'm sure there's something we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.44,0:14:42.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不过我觉得我们能做点什么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.44,0:14:44.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Also, for example, one obvious thing is...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.44,0:14:44.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}还有 举个很明显的例子…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.00,0:14:46.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, I just heard a Yellowhammer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.00,0:14:46.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我刚才听到了一只黄鹀
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.88,0:14:47.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[birds chirping]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.84,0:14:49.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[chuckles] What, while you were talking? -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.84,0:14:49.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-什么 在你说话的时候？ -对
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.84,0:14:52.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[phone buzzing]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.84,0:14:52.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（黄鹀）
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.44,0:14:53.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[soft music]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.64,0:14:55.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  We then headed to another part of the farm,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.64,0:14:55.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后我们去了农场的另一处
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.88,0:15:00.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}with Hannah drowning me in trivia about swifts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.88,0:15:00.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}汉娜一路上不停地给我讲雨燕的趣事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.12,0:15:01.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Hannah] Their first maiden flight: three years, no landing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.12,0:15:01.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们第一次离巢飞行
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.88,0:15:04.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Jeremy] Three years? -Three years.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.88,0:15:04.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}三年都不会落地
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.12,0:15:08.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They mate in the sky, they eat in the sky, they sleep in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.12,0:15:05.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-三年？ -三年
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.44,0:15:08.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们在天空中交配 在天空中觅食 在天空中睡觉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.28,0:15:10.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Jeremy] How can you sleep and... -Oh, wait, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.28,0:15:10.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-怎么能一边睡觉一边… -等等 你看
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.28,0:15:12.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Can we just stop the car, 'cause this is like the most insane...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.28,0:15:12.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你能停一下车吗 因为这太离谱了…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.44,0:15:13.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[car door slamming]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.76,0:15:17.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So she's just ordered me to stop the car
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.76,0:15:17.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}她刚才直接命令我停车
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.88,0:15:21.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and literally leapt out while it was still moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.88,0:15:21.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后车还在动 她就跳了出去
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.08,0:15:22.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You've got a really special bird!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.08,0:15:22.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你这里有一种非常特别的鸟！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.96,0:15:25.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Jeremy] What is it? -I've never heard one in real life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.96,0:15:25.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-什么鸟？ -我从来没在野外听到过
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.56,0:15:27.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Jeremy] What is it? -It's a Corn Bunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.56,0:15:27.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-什么鸟？ -黍鹀
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.24,0:15:30.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is like the most exciting thing ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.24,0:15:30.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这简直是最激动人心的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.72,0:15:34.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  And almost as though it wanted to give Hannah an extra treat,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.72,0:15:34.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好像是为了给汉娜额外奖励似的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.88,0:15:37.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}this Corn Bunting made an actual appearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.88,0:15:37.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这只黍鹀真的现身了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.40,0:15:41.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Hannah] There. -[Jeremy] Oh, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.40,0:15:41.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-那儿 -好！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.16,0:15:43.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Hannah] That's a Corn Bunting. -A Corn Bunting!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.16,0:15:43.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-那就是黍鹀 -黍鹀
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.00,0:15:46.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Hannah] That is so cool! [laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.00,0:15:46.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}太酷了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.00,0:15:49.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[country music]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.76,0:15:53.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  We concluded this happy tour by visiting a field we'd given over
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.76,0:15:53.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们这次愉快的观鸟之旅
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.08,0:15:57.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to one of the government's environmental schemes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.08,0:15:57.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}最后来到了一个 被我们划给政府环保项目的地块
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.44,0:16:02.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] So this is rye grass. This was part of the scheme.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.44,0:16:02.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这个是黑麦草 是计划的一部分
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.48,0:16:05.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Kaleb's... Look, he's been along and he's making silage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.48,0:16:05.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}卡莱布…你看 他已经来过 在割草做青贮
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.44,0:16:07.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Hannah] Oh fuck. -What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.44,0:16:07.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-操 -怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.60,0:16:11.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Hannah moaning in disgust] Well, that's bloody awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.60,0:16:11.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这太糟糕了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.08,0:16:12.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I might vomit in your car.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.08,0:16:12.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我都想吐你车里了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.80,0:16:14.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] What's he done wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.80,0:16:14.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他做错什么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.24,0:16:19.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Hannah sighing] So Skylarks and other birds
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.24,0:16:21.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}云雀和其他鸟类会在庄稼地里筑巢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.16,0:16:21.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}will nest in the crops.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.64,0:16:23.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So... urgh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.64,0:16:23.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以…你要是再等两周 它们…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.32,0:16:27.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If you'd just waited another two weeks, he wouldn't have killed any of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.32,0:16:27.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他就不会害死任何鸟了 但如果青贮做得太早
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.56,0:16:30.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But there's a very good chance, if you silage too soon
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.56,0:16:31.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}很可能会把所有小鸟都弄死
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.32,0:16:32.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}you kill all the chicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.44,0:16:34.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Hannah grunting] -[Jeremy] He said
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.44,0:16:36.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他说如果现在割掉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.48,0:16:36.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}if he cuts it now
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.72,0:16:40.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and then makes this into silage to feed the cows in the winter,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.72,0:16:40.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}把这些做成青贮 冬天喂牛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.76,0:16:45.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}by doing it now, the grass will have a chance to regrow
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.76,0:16:45.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这样草还有机会再长
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.08,0:16:47.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and he'll get two cuts of silage in the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.08,0:16:47.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一年就能收两茬青贮
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.60,0:16:49.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, great, lucky him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.60,0:16:49.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 真好 他可真幸运
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.36,0:16:53.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Now we'll just have squashed chicks instead of living ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.36,0:16:53.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}只是我们现在会面对被压死的小鸟 而不是活着的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.36,0:16:55.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Erm...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.64,0:16:56.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}he cut this yesterday. He's gonna bag it today I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.64,0:16:56.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他昨天割的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.80,0:17:00.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So would there have been chicks in here, or eggs,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.80,0:16:58.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-我想他今天就要打捆了 -天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.64,0:17:00.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以这个季节 这里面会有
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.72,0:17:02.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-this time of year? -There'll be chicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.72,0:17:02.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-小鸟或者鸟蛋吗？ -会有小鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.72,0:17:04.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Jeremy] And he's minced them? -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.72,0:17:04.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-然后他就把它们绞碎了？ -对
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.12,0:17:05.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look, there's a Skylark right there,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.12,0:17:05.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看 那儿就有一只云雀
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.80,0:17:08.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}probably crying over its dead family.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.80,0:17:08.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}可能在为它死去的家人哭泣
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.52,0:17:10.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.52,0:17:10.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.96,0:17:12.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[tense music]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.96,0:17:16.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  The next field due to be cut for silage was the GS4 field
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.96,0:17:16.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}下一块要割了做青贮的地
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.40,0:17:20.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we'd put the sheeps in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.40,0:17:20.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就是我们放羊的那块GS4地
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.80,0:17:24.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And because I could see both points of view,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.80,0:17:24.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}由于我能理解双方的想法
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.76,0:17:28.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hannah and I went there the next day,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.76,0:17:28.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}第二天我和汉娜
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.16,0:17:30.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}after the sheeps had been moved,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.16,0:17:31.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在羊群被转移后 去了那块地 堵卡莱布
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.32,0:17:32.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to intercept Kaleb.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.88,0:17:35.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Hell of an evening, though, isn't it? -[Hannah] It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.88,0:17:35.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-这傍晚真不错 是吧？ -很美
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.00,0:17:35.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] I mean, just...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.00,0:17:35.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我是说…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.00,0:17:38.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If we weren't talking about the mullering of a red-listed,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.00,0:17:38.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}要不是我们要讨论
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.16,0:17:43.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}threatened-with-extinction bird, it would be a really relaxing evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.16,0:17:41.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一只红色名录 濒临灭绝鸟类的屠杀事件
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.44,0:17:43.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这本来会是一个非常宁静的黄昏
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.20,0:17:46.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-I'm doing my best here. -I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.20,0:17:46.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-我已经在尽力了 -我知道！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.68,0:17:48.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[engine revving]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.68,0:17:50.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}想象一下 如果你是一只小云雀 看到那东西朝你过来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.44,0:17:50.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Imagine if you were a baby Skylark with that coming towards you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.08,0:17:51.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What, Kaleb?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.08,0:17:51.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}什么 卡莱布？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.36,0:17:56.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hannah, this is Kaleb.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.36,0:17:56.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}汉娜 这是卡莱布
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.60,0:17:58.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] Hannah, lovely to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.60,0:17:58.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-汉娜 幸会 -你好！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.00,0:17:58.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Hannah] Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.96,0:18:02.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  With us all gathered together, I called the meeting to order.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.96,0:18:02.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}人都到齐了 我宣布会议开始
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.00,0:18:04.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.00,0:18:04.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了 你们俩
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.56,0:18:07.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Erm, case for the prosecution, case for the defence.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.56,0:18:07.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}检方发言 辩方发言
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.00,0:18:09.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Hannah moaning] -Judge.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.00,0:18:09.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我来当法官
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.44,0:18:12.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You want to go out there literally now and cut it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.44,0:18:11.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你现在想马上出去…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.84,0:18:13.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-对 我… -…割草
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.08,0:18:15.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-And you say if he goes out there now... -Mullering.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.08,0:18:15.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而你说如果他现在去…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.52,0:18:18.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Jeremy] He's going to decapitate... -Twenty-four chicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.52,0:18:17.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-屠杀 -…他会斩首…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.80,0:18:19.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}24只小鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.12,0:18:22.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}From the Skylark's point of view, they have an average of four eggs
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.12,0:18:22.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}从云雀的角度看 它们平均每窝四颗蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.12,0:18:24.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and there are probably six nests with the Corn Bunting,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.12,0:18:24.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}再加上黍鹀 大概有六个窝
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.60,0:18:26.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}so that's 24 chicks, let's say.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.60,0:18:26.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那就是24只小鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.12,0:18:28.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-In this field? -In this 21 hectares, in all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.12,0:18:28.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-就这块地？ -就这21公顷 整个这块地
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.64,0:18:33.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] So when would it be safe to silage this field?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.64,0:18:33.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那什么时候割这块地才安全？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.16,0:18:36.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Four and a half weeks after they stopped laying and started incubating,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.16,0:18:36.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们停止下蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.28,0:18:39.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which would be about the 16th of July.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.28,0:18:39.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}开始孵化后四周半 大概7月16号
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.12,0:18:40.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Okay, so seventeen days. -[Hannah] Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.12,0:18:40.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-好的 还有17天 -7月16号
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.92,0:18:44.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Can you wait 17 days before silaging this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.92,0:18:41.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.84,0:18:44.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你能等17天再割吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.40,0:18:47.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.40,0:18:47.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不行 真不行
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.20,0:18:48.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'll tell you for why.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.20,0:18:48.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我跟你说为什么 现在的饲料营养价值最高
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.24,0:18:50.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The nutritional value for the food now is great
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.24,0:18:52.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为草还是绿的之类的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.76,0:18:52.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because, of course, it's green and so on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.24,0:18:53.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If we wait seventeen days,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.24,0:18:53.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}再等17天 天这么热
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.48,0:18:56.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}with this heat here, it's gonna die off and become half dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.48,0:18:56.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}草会枯掉 半死不活的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.68,0:18:58.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So therefore, we lose all the nutritional value.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.68,0:18:58.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那样营养价值就全没了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.68,0:19:00.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We're gonna be short on cow food. We're already short now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.68,0:19:00.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们喂牛的饲料会不够 现在已经不够了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.04,0:19:03.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We might have to start feeding our winter resources now
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.04,0:19:03.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们可能现在就得开始 动用冬天的储备了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.00,0:19:05.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}'cause we're so short on grass.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.00,0:19:05.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为草太少了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.12,0:19:07.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So you've already mullered the rye grass Skylarks,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.12,0:19:07.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你已经把黑麦草里的云雀给屠了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.76,0:19:10.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}so you kinda have to make the decision whether you want to actively contribute
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.76,0:19:10.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在你得决定 你是否要主动加速农田鸟类的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.60,0:19:12.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to the decimation of farmland birds...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.60,0:19:12.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-灭绝 -不 这…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.08,0:19:14.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, no, it's what the bloody hell to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.08,0:19:16.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这他妈到底该怎么办 不好意思 你想今晚就去割
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.36,0:19:16.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm sorry, you want to go tonight,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.48,0:19:18.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and it's already half past seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.48,0:19:18.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在都七点半了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.40,0:19:19.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.40,0:19:20.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我得做个决定
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.68,0:19:20.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I've gotta make a decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.04,0:19:23.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-I've got a compromise. -I've had a... Oh, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.04,0:19:23.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-我有个折中方案 -我有个…什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.52,0:19:24.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So, put the chain on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.52,0:19:24.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}把链子挂上
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.04,0:19:26.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Jeremy] What's the chain? -[Kaleb] So it's like
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.04,0:19:26.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}什么链子？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.48,0:19:28.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}on my mower, on my front mower, you have like a chain hanging beforehand
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.48,0:19:28.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就像我的割草机 前面那台
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.92,0:19:31.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which is about two metres out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.92,0:19:31.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}提前挂一条链子 大概两米长
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.64,0:19:33.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So therefore when it rattles, yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.64,0:19:33.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这样链子哗啦啦响的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.32,0:19:35.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}before it gets to that nest or that bird...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.32,0:19:35.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在割草机到达鸟窝或那只鸟之前…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.20,0:19:36.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, but if they're only chicks?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.20,0:19:36.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-对 但如果只是小鸟呢？ -小鸟可能会死
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.88,0:19:38.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, the chicks will probably die, but the mums and dads will...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.88,0:19:38.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-但鸟爸鸟妈会… -所以链子解决不了…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.96,0:19:41.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Yeah, so then... -OK, so the chain isn't going to solve...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.96,0:19:42.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 说实话 那个更多是用来赶鹿的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.00,0:19:42.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's more for deers, to be honest with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.64,0:19:44.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm just trying to focus on the Skylarks, 'cause I know they're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.64,0:19:44.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我只是想专注在云雀上
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.60,0:19:46.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}'Cause you can hear them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.60,0:19:46.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为我知道它们在这儿 我们能听到它们
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.68,0:19:47.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Can't see 'em now. -Well, you can hear them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.68,0:19:47.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在看不见
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.76,0:19:49.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Hannah] We... -[Kaleb] Can't hear 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.76,0:19:49.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-所以我们… -但你能听到
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.12,0:19:51.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Jeremy] I can just hear... -Look, there's one there, right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.12,0:19:51.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-我只能听到一条狗在喘气… -因为我们都在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.36,0:19:55.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Singing right there. -[Jeremy] That's a Skylark. Look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.36,0:19:53.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看 那儿有一只 就在那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.44,0:19:55.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-在那儿唱歌 -那是云雀 你看它
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.68,0:19:58.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, 'cause its babies are over there, look, not in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.68,0:19:58.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 因为它的宝宝在那边 你看 不在这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.12,0:19:59.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-All right... -Anyway, the point is...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.12,0:19:59.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-好吧 -总之 重点是…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.68,0:20:01.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So the chain isn't going to save the babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.68,0:20:01.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以链子救不了小鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.92,0:20:05.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So the most important thing is cut higher than you might normally do,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.92,0:20:03.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 最重要的是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.36,0:20:05.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}割的时候比平时留高一点
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.48,0:20:07.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}so five inches or twelve centimetres.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.48,0:20:07.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}留五英寸 也就是12厘米
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.28,0:20:09.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't think I can, though, 'cause the bed still lays...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.28,0:20:09.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得我可能做不到 因为割台还是会贴地…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.44,0:20:12.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't think that's gonna able the chicks to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.44,0:20:12.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得…我觉得那样小鸟也活不了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.36,0:20:15.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The bed of the mower goes across the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.36,0:20:15.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}割草机的割台是贴着地面走的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.64,0:20:16.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-All I'm doing is doing this. -What's the bed? I don't know what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.64,0:20:16.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-我只是… -什么是…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.92,0:20:18.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The bed of the mower.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.92,0:20:18.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-我不知道什么是割台 -割草机的割台
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.96,0:20:20.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So look, if we go to the back...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.96,0:20:20.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们到后面去 更容易看清…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.64,0:20:24.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  Kaleb then took us over to show us what he meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.64,0:20:24.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}卡莱布随后带我们过去 向我们演示他的意思
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.12,0:20:26.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] This is what sits on the ground, look. That's what I'm saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.12,0:20:26.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这就是贴着地面的那个东西 你们看 我刚才说的就是这个
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.76,0:20:28.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-That's a skid. -[Jeremy] Well, where are the blades?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.76,0:20:28.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-那刀片在哪儿？ -那是个滑板
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.64,0:20:29.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Here, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.64,0:20:29.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这儿 你们看
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.56,0:20:31.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] This spins round, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.56,0:20:31.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这个会转动 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.60,0:20:35.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then, so it slices the little bird's head off
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.60,0:20:35.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后它会把小鸟的头切掉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.80,0:20:39.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and then the rest of the bird is smeared into the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.80,0:20:39.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}剩下的身体就这样碾进地里
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.08,0:20:41.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Hannah] Like a smash burger. -[Kaleb] It might go underneath it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.08,0:20:41.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-就像压扁汉堡一样 -不过小鸟可能会从底下过去
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.40,0:20:43.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Why can't you just lift the whole friggin' thing up?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.40,0:20:43.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你为什么就不能 把那玩意儿整个抬起来？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.92,0:20:45.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}'Cause it's not how it works. It's designed to sit on the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.92,0:20:45.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为那样的话…它就不是那么设计的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.92,0:20:47.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Can you push this up so it's five inches?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.92,0:20:47.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它就是设计成贴地运行的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.44,0:20:49.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Kaleb] No. -[Hannah] Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.44,0:20:49.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你能把这个抬到12厘米高吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.72,0:20:52.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Because that's the stabiliser.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.72,0:20:51.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-不行 -为什么不行？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.16,0:20:52.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为那是稳定器
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.52,0:20:56.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This proves how shit it is for birds if you're nesting and you're up to here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.52,0:20:56.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这恰恰说明了 如果你是鸟 在这高度筑巢有多糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.68,0:20:58.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What I'm saying is every single mower's like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.68,0:20:58.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我的意思是 所有割草机都这样
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.76,0:21:02.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, that's why there's a national population decline of 63%
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.76,0:21:02.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 这就是为什么全国鸟类种群数量 下降了百分之六十三
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.80,0:21:04.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because everybody's mowing like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.80,0:21:05.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-因为大家都这么割草 -但你看 我可以这样
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.24,0:21:05.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] What I can do, you see, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.48,0:21:08.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}These go down, and you've got that little bit there, look, you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.48,0:21:07.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你往下割的时候 有那一块在那儿 看见了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.68,0:21:09.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后这就…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.40,0:21:10.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Hannah] This is like a fucking shit show.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.40,0:21:10.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这他该死简直是一场灾难
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.84,0:21:12.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] But I'll just mow it. It won't take me two minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.84,0:21:12.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我会割草 用不了两分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.52,0:21:15.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-You're saying: "They'll die quickly." -[Kaleb] No, no, they won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.52,0:21:14.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你的意思是说：“它们会死得很快”
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.16,0:21:15.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 它们不会
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.36,0:21:19.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  It was time to end the arguing and make a decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.36,0:21:19.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}该结束争论 做个决定了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.84,0:21:29.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm gonna say, do not cut this tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.84,0:21:29.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我说 今晚别割这块地了 行吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.88,0:21:31.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Yeah? -Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.88,0:21:31.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}行
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.04,0:21:35.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] I'll see if I can come up with a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.04,0:21:35.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好 我看看能不能想个办法
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.68,0:21:42.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.68,0:21:42.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}操
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.40,0:21:48.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[soft music]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.32,0:21:51.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[birds chirping]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.16,0:21:54.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  I needed a plan that would save the Skylarks
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.16,0:21:54.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我需要一个既能救云雀
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.28,0:21:57.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}without hurting the farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.28,0:21:57.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}又不伤害农场的办法
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.44,0:21:59.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But there was no time to come up with one,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.44,0:21:59.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但没时间想了 因为第二天
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.48,0:22:01.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because the next day,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.48,0:22:03.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们还有别的鸟事要处理
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.32,0:22:04.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we had other bird business to attend to.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.48,0:22:05.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[geese cackling]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.12,0:22:07.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lisa] Come on. This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.12,0:22:07.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}来 这边走
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.80,0:22:09.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Have you ever herded geese?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.80,0:22:09.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你赶过鹅吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.68,0:22:11.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Kaleb] Weirdly, no. -I haven't either.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.68,0:22:11.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-说来也怪 没有 -我也没有
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.96,0:22:14.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  Lisa had bought another gaggle of geeses
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.96,0:22:14.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}丽莎为了在酒吧办她的鹅之夜
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.92,0:22:18.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}for her Goose Night endeavours at the pub.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.92,0:22:18.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}又买了一批鹅
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.28,0:22:22.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And this lot now needed moving down to their new living quarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.28,0:22:22.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在这批鹅需要搬到它们的新住处去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.88,0:22:26.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] They really do walk in a funny way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.88,0:22:26.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们走路的样子真好笑
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.92,0:22:27.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.84,0:22:29.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] I feel like I'm Amish. You know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.84,0:22:29.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-我感觉自己像阿米什人 -对
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.44,0:22:30.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lisa] How do you know what an Amish person is?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.44,0:22:30.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-阿米什人 懂我意思吧？ -懂
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.92,0:22:34.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] I just watch 'em build barns. They're really fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.92,0:22:32.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你怎么知道阿米什人是怎么样的？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.56,0:22:34.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我就是看他们盖谷仓 他们盖得特别快
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.92,0:22:36.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[playful music]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.52,0:22:38.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lisa] That is beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.52,0:22:38.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}真美
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.80,0:22:40.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] Can we do this every day?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.80,0:22:40.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们能天天干这个吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.32,0:22:42.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Jeremy] I'd like to do this. -[Kaleb] This is fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.32,0:22:42.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-我愿意干这个 -真好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.24,0:22:44.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Not far now, geeses.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.24,0:22:44.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不远了 鹅们
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.92,0:22:46.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lisa] Geese, geese, geese!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.92,0:22:46.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}鹅
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.72,0:22:49.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There we go, look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.72,0:22:49.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了 你看那儿！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.44,0:22:53.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] And there they are. They've got their shade, their water, their house.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.44,0:22:51.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们到了 有遮阴的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.64,0:22:53.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}有水 有房子
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.76,0:22:54.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Santa's grotto.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.76,0:22:54.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}圣诞老人小屋
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.00,0:22:57.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] I know. Has it still got that bit of thing in the middle of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.00,0:22:57.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道 中间那个东西还在吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.32,0:22:58.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] No!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.32,0:22:58.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不在了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.40,0:23:00.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lisa] So last year I just used half.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.40,0:23:01.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}去年我只用了一半 今年我得全用上了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.04,0:23:01.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This year, I'm gonna have to use all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.96,0:23:03.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, for God's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.96,0:23:03.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我的天
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.04,0:23:06.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Mother of Christ, Jeremy, who left these in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.04,0:23:06.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}老天爷啊 杰里米 谁把这些留在这儿的？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.80,0:23:07.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.80,0:23:07.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-怎么回事？ -什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.80,0:23:09.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lisa] We've got Mother of Christ, literally.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.80,0:23:09.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们这里真的有“圣母玛利亚”
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.04,0:23:12.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.76,0:23:15.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lisa] Is this some joke? Ha-ha, very funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.76,0:23:15.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-这是开玩笑吗？真好笑 -不 不是开玩笑 说真的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.28,0:23:17.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, it's not a joke, honestly. I'd, honestly...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.28,0:23:17.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我说真的…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.28,0:23:19.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, shit, I've broken their ramp.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.28,0:23:19.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-操 我把斜坡弄坏了 -他…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.76,0:23:21.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lisa] Yeah, you need to keep going on the fat jabs.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.76,0:23:21.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 你得继续打那些减肥针
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.76,0:23:23.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Jeremy] Yeah, the Mounjaro ramp. -[Kaleb laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.76,0:23:23.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 芒扎罗斜坡
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.96,0:23:27.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] I think there's enough for it not to be hobby farming.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.96,0:23:27.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得这规模 已经不算靠爱好搞农业了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.08,0:23:30.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Kaleb] Er, well. -[Jeremy] Borderline, but.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.08,0:23:30.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-嗯… -勉强算吧 但…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.28,0:23:33.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Goose Night did well last year, so it's not hobby farming, I don't think.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.28,0:23:31.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}去年的鹅之夜办得不错
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.56,0:23:34.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-所以我觉得不算靠爱好搞农业 -确实不错
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.20,0:23:37.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  Kaleb then headed off thinking the job was complete,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.20,0:23:37.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}卡莱布以为事情做完了就走了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.72,0:23:40.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but, er, it wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.72,0:23:40.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但其实并没有
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.96,0:23:42.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh shit, the fence is off.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.96,0:23:42.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}操 电围栏关了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.76,0:23:44.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lisa] Oh fuck, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.76,0:23:44.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}操 不！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.84,0:23:46.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Jeremy] Lisa, quickly. -[Lisa] Geese, geese, geese!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.84,0:23:46.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-丽莎 快 -鹅！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.52,0:23:48.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Jeremy] That way. Go on! -[Lisa] Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.52,0:23:48.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-往那边 快走！ -快来！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.08,0:23:49.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] We've got them. Now...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.08,0:23:49.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们现在围住它们了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.84,0:23:52.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.84,0:23:52.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天哪 不
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.52,0:23:54.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-No. Uh-uh-uh. -[Lisa] Eejits. come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.52,0:23:54.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}傻瓜们 快来
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.44,0:23:55.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Jeremy] No, no. -[Lisa] Over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.44,0:23:55.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-不 -这边
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.40,0:23:56.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Oh, shitting hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.40,0:23:56.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}该死
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.12,0:24:00.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is just ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.12,0:24:00.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这太荒唐了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.72,0:24:02.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Is it on?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.72,0:24:02.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}开了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.68,0:24:04.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lisa] It's on.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.68,0:24:04.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}开了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.72,0:24:06.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Right, now they're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.72,0:24:06.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了 现在它们安全了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.76,0:24:09.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They're about to get their first lesson in electricity.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.76,0:24:09.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们马上就要上第一堂电击课了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.96,0:24:11.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[squawking loudly]
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.40,0:24:12.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Oh. -[squawking]
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.24,0:24:17.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, poor geeses!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.24,0:24:17.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}可怜的鹅们
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.52,0:24:23.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  Nevertheless, they were now protected from the foxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.52,0:24:23.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不过 它们现在总算不用怕狐狸了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.16,0:24:26.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And with that done, I went off with Charlie
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.16,0:24:26.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}完事后 我和查理
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.80,0:24:29.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to check on some other newcomers to Diddly Squat.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.80,0:24:29.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}去查看迪丽斯库阿特的其他新成员
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.52,0:24:31.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Hello, donkeys!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.52,0:24:31.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你们好 驴子们！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.96,0:24:35.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}My granddaughter has decided they're not called Bill and Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.96,0:24:35.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我孙女决定不叫它们比尔和本了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.48,0:24:37.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}She called them Ben and Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.48,0:24:37.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}她管它们叫本和本
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.64,0:24:41.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I feel now I...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.64,0:24:41.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我感觉我现在…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.16,0:24:44.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-I'm on a petting zoo, a petting farm. -[Jeremy] Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.16,0:24:44.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我像是在宠物动物园
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.48,0:24:47.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-There's nothing wrong with having them. -Do they take your fingers off when...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.48,0:24:47.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}拜托 我觉得养驴没什么不对
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.08,0:24:48.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.08,0:24:48.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们会咬掉你的手指吗…你好！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.96,0:24:51.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Have you felt how soft it is? -[Jeremy] I know, it's stunning.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.96,0:24:50.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你摸到它有多软了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.36,0:24:51.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道 太软了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.88,0:24:54.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I know that you say "petting zoo", blah blah blah...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.88,0:24:54.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道你说“宠物动物园”…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.08,0:24:55.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Charlie] No, I'm joking. It's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.08,0:24:55.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 我开玩笑的 这太棒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.76,0:24:58.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You know, that's what a lot of people forget about farming,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.76,0:24:58.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}很多人忘记了农业的一点
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.48,0:25:00.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-is that you've gotta enjoy it. -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.48,0:25:00.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-就是你要乐在其中 -对
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.24,0:25:03.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Like the birds, the animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.24,0:25:03.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就像鸟啊 动物啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.60,0:25:04.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Have I got one more?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.60,0:25:04.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}能再给我一根吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.32,0:25:07.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Listen to the sound when they eat a carrot.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.32,0:25:07.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你听它们吃胡萝卜的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.88,0:25:11.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[munching loudly]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.60,0:25:17.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[munching continues]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.00,0:25:22.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[soft music]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.16,0:25:25.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  Back in the car, I brought Charlie up to speed
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.16,0:25:25.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}回到车上 我跟查理说了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.88,0:25:27.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}with the problem of Kaleb and Hannah
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.88,0:25:27.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}卡莱布和汉娜因为鸟的事
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.36,0:25:30.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}being at loggerheads over the birds.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.36,0:25:30.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}闹僵的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.88,0:25:33.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] So can you see my dilemma?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.88,0:25:33.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以你明白我的两难处境了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.36,0:25:35.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Cut it now: we get silage,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.36,0:25:35.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在割 我们有青贮饲料
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.92,0:25:38.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but we kill all the skylarks and the corn buntings
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.92,0:25:38.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但会杀死所有的云雀、黍鹀 和那块地里筑巢的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.16,0:25:40.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and all the other birds that have nested in that field.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.16,0:25:40.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-所有其他鸟 -对
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.60,0:25:44.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean, have you tried walking through that GS4 field with the chicory in it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.60,0:25:44.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你有没有走过那片种了菊苣的地？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.12,0:25:45.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-It's bloody impossible. -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.12,0:25:45.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-根本走不进去 -对
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.04,0:25:50.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It would take an army three hundred years to find a skylark nest in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.04,0:25:50.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}派一支军队花三百年 都未必能在里面找到一个云雀窝
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.08,0:25:53.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Charlie] Erm, now, I don't know,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.08,0:25:55.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不知道 但现在可以用无人机
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.20,0:25:55.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but they can use drones
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.40,0:25:58.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to heat-seek grey partridges now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.40,0:25:58.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}热成像来找灰山鹑
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.48,0:26:01.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So where people are having grey partridge projects,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.48,0:26:01.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 有人做灰山鹑项目的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.28,0:26:02.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}they're putting a drone up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.28,0:26:02.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}会放无人机
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.84,0:26:06.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So you could go up at night and then you can literally pinpoint where they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.84,0:26:06.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你晚上放飞无人机 就能精确定位它们的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.48,0:26:07.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.56,0:26:09.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, I wonder who's got a drone?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.56,0:26:09.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那谁有无人机呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.56,0:26:11.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[chuckling]
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.84,0:26:12.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[drone buzzing]
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.96,0:26:14.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  Yep, we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.96,0:26:14.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 我们有
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.84,0:26:19.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So I went off immediately to find Chris, the man who flies it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.84,0:26:17.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我立刻去找无人机飞手
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.92,0:26:19.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}克里斯
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.92,0:26:23.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Charlie was just saying if we had a heat-seeking drone,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.92,0:26:23.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}查理刚才说 如果我们有热成像无人机
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.04,0:26:27.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}it might be able to locate the skylark nests.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.04,0:26:27.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}也许能定位田地里的…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.44,0:26:28.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Yeah. -In the fields.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.44,0:26:28.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-对 -…云雀窝
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.40,0:26:30.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}In theory, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.40,0:26:31.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-理论上可以 -我们知道它们在哪个地里
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.92,0:26:31.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We know which field they're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.92,0:26:33.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So you know they're definitely in a field, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.92,0:26:33.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你确定它们一定在那块地里？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.56,0:26:34.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Jeremy] Yeah. -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.56,0:26:34.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-对 -对
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.56,0:26:36.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So we've got drones that have got thermal cameras,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.56,0:26:36.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 我们有一台 带热成像摄像头的无人机
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.72,0:26:38.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}not this one, but it's about the same size as this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.72,0:26:38.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不是这台 但大小差不多
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.44,0:26:40.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-So it wouldn't disturb the birds. -[Charlie] Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.44,0:26:40.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-那样就不会惊扰到鸟 -对
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.44,0:26:43.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But you need a very specific scenario.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.44,0:26:43.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但需要非常特定的条件
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.28,0:26:45.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So, for a thermal camera to work,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.28,0:26:45.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}热成像要起作用 需要看到
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.12,0:26:47.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}it needs to see a difference between something hot and something cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.12,0:26:47.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}冷热物体之间的温差
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.92,0:26:50.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So we would have to do it very early in the morning
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.92,0:26:50.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我们得在太阳出来
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.56,0:26:52.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}before the sun came up and warmed the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.56,0:26:52.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}把地面晒热之前 清晨很早的时候飞
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.80,0:26:54.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, Sunday it's down to sixteen degrees apparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.80,0:26:54.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}周日据说会降到16度
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.00,0:26:56.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So that could work.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.00,0:26:56.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那应该可以 我们可能得
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.08,0:26:58.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We'd have to do it probably about four o'clock in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.08,0:26:58.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}凌晨四点左右飞
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.08,0:26:59.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[cash drawer opening]
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.08,0:26:59.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（加班！）
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.52,0:27:02.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Again, before the sun comes up and warms the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.52,0:27:02.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}再次申明 要赶在太阳出来 地面变热之前
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.24,0:27:03.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And we would have to hope that the birds were giving off
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.24,0:27:03.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而且我们得指望
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.96,0:27:05.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}some kind of heat signature.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.96,0:27:05.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}鸟能发出某种热信号
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.76,0:27:08.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So obviously the birds they're designed to conserve their heat with feathers,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.76,0:27:08.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}显然 鸟的羽毛是为了保温而生的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.96,0:27:11.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  Before I got sucked into a drone-operated,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.96,0:27:11.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-但只要窝里… -在我被无人机操作员的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.08,0:27:15.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}tech-speak black hole...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.08,0:27:15.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}科技术语黑洞吸进去之前…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.60,0:27:16.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[locking sound]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.76,0:27:18.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I said yes to Chris.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.76,0:27:18.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我对克里斯说了行
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.08,0:27:20.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[drone buzzing]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.56,0:27:24.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And the following morning at 4 a.m.,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.56,0:27:24.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}第二天凌晨四点
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.36,0:27:26.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}he was duly in position,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.36,0:27:26.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他准时到位
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.08,0:27:29.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}ready to initiate Operation Skylark.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.08,0:27:29.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}准备开始“云雀行动”
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.96,0:27:33.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[tense music]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.96,0:27:33.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（标准模式 - 手动飞行）
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.88,0:27:36.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Once Chris had finished his sweep,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.88,0:27:36.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}克里斯完成扫描后
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.76,0:27:40.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the images were downloaded to Mission Control,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.76,0:27:40.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}图像被下载到任务控制中心…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.84,0:27:43.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}so I could see if he'd found anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.84,0:27:43.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这样我就能看到他发现了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.68,0:27:48.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Erm, OK, cold earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.68,0:27:48.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了 凌晨四点半的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.72,0:27:51.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which it was at half past four in the morning, is pink.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.72,0:27:51.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}冷地面是粉色的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.80,0:27:55.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Plenty of the sheep sticking around up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.80,0:27:55.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那边有不少羊在活动
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.12,0:27:57.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But these greeny-yellow splodges
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.12,0:27:57.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但这些黄绿色的斑块
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.44,0:28:00.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}are patches of warmth.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.44,0:28:00.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是温暖区域
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.28,0:28:01.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And that
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.28,0:28:04.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那就有可能是云雀窝
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.76,0:28:05.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}is a potential skylark nest.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.48,0:28:09.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.48,0:28:09.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.68,0:28:12.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}'Cause we never ever would have found that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.68,0:28:12.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为我们靠肉眼永远都找不到那个
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.76,0:28:14.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.76,0:28:15.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}又一个 看 那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.36,0:28:15.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.64,0:28:17.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.64,0:28:17.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}难以置信
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.92,0:28:21.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So anyway, we got all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.92,0:28:21.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}总之 我们得到了所有这些 然后
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.36,0:28:25.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then here's where it gets really quite clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.36,0:28:25.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}接下来才是真正高明的部分
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.80,0:28:28.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I feel like I'm in a Jason Bourne movie here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.80,0:28:28.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我感觉自己像在演《谍影重重》
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.40,0:28:32.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So this is one of the five skylark nests
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.40,0:28:32.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是我们在“谷仓地”里
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.32,0:28:35.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}that we found in Barn Ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.32,0:28:35.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}找到的五个云雀窝之一
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.56,0:28:37.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Juxtapose that
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.56,0:28:41.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}把这个和谷歌地图放在一起看
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.96,0:28:41.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}with Google Maps.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.28,0:28:43.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So we know it's there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.28,0:28:43.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们就知道它在哪儿了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.12,0:28:44.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And from that we've been able to get
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.12,0:28:48.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}由此 我们得到了 一个精确的“三词地址”位置
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.96,0:28:48.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}a precise What3words location.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.56,0:28:51.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So I'll go in my phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.56,0:28:51.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我在手机上看
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.20,0:28:54.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes, and there it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.20,0:28:54.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好 显示出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.16,0:28:58.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}In that three-metre square is a skylark nest.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.16,0:28:58.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那个三米见方的方格里有一个云雀窝
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.28,0:28:59.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'll go mark it,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.28,0:28:59.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我去做标记 卡莱布开车绕过去
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.64,0:29:02.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Kaleb drives round it, he gets his silage,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.64,0:29:04.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他会拿到他的青贮饲料 而所有小云雀都能活下来
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.52,0:29:04.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}all the skylark chicks survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.08,0:29:06.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[tense rock music]
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.80,0:29:09.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  Armed with this Langley-style surveillance,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.80,0:29:09.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}有了这种中情局级别的侦查手段
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.40,0:29:12.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I got hold of Lisa and we headed to the field
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.40,0:29:12.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我联系了丽莎 我们一起去了地里
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.60,0:29:17.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}so we could locate and mark the nest sites with flags.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.60,0:29:17.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}用旗子定位并标记出鸟巢的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.80,0:29:18.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.80,0:29:18.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.28,0:29:24.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lisa] Seventy-five metres away.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.28,0:29:24.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}75米远
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.60,0:29:29.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Ooh, this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.60,0:29:29.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这边走
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.56,0:29:32.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm still watching where I put my feet in case I tread on one.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.56,0:29:32.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我现在走路都在盯着脚下 生怕踩到一个
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.12,0:29:36.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lisa] Thirty-nine metres.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.12,0:29:36.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}39米
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.20,0:29:39.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.20,0:29:39.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这边走
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.12,0:29:41.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lisa] Fifteen.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.12,0:29:41.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}15米
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.72,0:29:45.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] I think we're getting quite close.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.72,0:29:45.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得我们很近了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.08,0:29:47.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lisa] Oh, six metres away.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.08,0:29:47.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}六米远
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.80,0:29:51.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] We're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.80,0:29:51.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们到了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.56,0:30:08.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, fuck's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.56,0:30:08.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}该死
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.08,0:30:14.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[sighing]
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.48,0:30:15.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[bleating]
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.96,0:30:18.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Fucking hell, honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.96,0:30:18.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我真他妈服了 说真的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.68,0:30:21.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  Yep, all the thermal camera had found
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.68,0:30:21.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 热像仪找到的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.36,0:30:24.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}were five piles of still-warm sheep shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.36,0:30:24.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}只是五堆还热乎的羊屎
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.40,0:30:31.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So, with no realistic way of locating the nests,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.40,0:30:31.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 既然没办法真的找到鸟巢
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.12,0:30:33.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I went with my heart rather than my head
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.12,0:30:33.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我决定跟着心走 而不是脑子
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.56,0:30:36.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and asked Kaleb to stand down
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.56,0:30:38.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我让卡莱布先别动手 等鸟飞走再说
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.72,0:30:38.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}until the chicks had flown away.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.52,0:30:42.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[playful music]
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.44,0:30:46.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Then, Hannah and I got on with another bird-related project.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.44,0:30:46.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后 我和汉娜 去忙另一个跟鸟有关的项目
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.84,0:30:51.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-So you're gonna walk in front? -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.84,0:30:51.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-所以 你走前面？ -好
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.24,0:30:52.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So that we don't mince a skylark or a corn bunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.24,0:30:52.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这样我们就不会碾到云雀
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.80,0:30:54.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.80,0:30:54.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-或者黍鹀了 -对
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.76,0:30:57.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right. Well, it's set to go 2.5 kilometres an hour
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.76,0:30:57.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 它设成了每小时两公里半
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.80,0:30:59.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-so you won't have to sprint. -[Hannah chuckling]
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.80,0:30:59.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以你不用跑
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.36,0:31:00.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Don't kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.36,0:31:00.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}别杀了我
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.52,0:31:02.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right, you go first.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.52,0:31:02.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好 你先走
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.64,0:31:07.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  Our plan was to create a winter pantry for the birds
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.64,0:31:07.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们的计划是在田地边缘的缓冲带里
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.32,0:31:10.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}in the margins at the edge of the fields.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.32,0:31:10.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}为鸟类创建一个冬季食物储藏室
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.48,0:31:13.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And job one was to mow the grass in the margins
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.48,0:31:13.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}第一项任务是用农业机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.52,0:31:17.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}using the AgBot and Kaleb's agricultural mower.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.52,0:31:17.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}和卡莱布的农用割草机 来割缓冲带里的草
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.04,0:31:20.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] What I will do for the dicky birds.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.04,0:31:20.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}为了那些小鸟 我真是豁出去了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.80,0:31:23.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  Once the mowing was complete,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.80,0:31:26.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}割完草后 我把播种机挂到农业机器人上…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.56,0:31:26.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I attached the cultivator to the AgBot...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.28,0:31:28.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[metallic creaking]
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.60,0:31:31.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}...so that it could break up the sun-baked soil.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.60,0:31:31.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这样它就能把被晒硬的土壤翻松
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.28,0:31:35.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[rattling]
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.76,0:31:39.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Hannah] That's not a good sound, is it? That's not how it should sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.76,0:31:39.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这个声音不对 是吧？ 听起来不该是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.64,0:31:42.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] We're gonna break it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.64,0:31:42.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们会把它弄坏的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.08,0:31:44.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[AgBot beeping]
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.52,0:31:45.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.52,0:31:45.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}等等
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.84,0:31:47.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[cultivator squeaking]
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.36,0:31:48.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Hannah] Oh, that's fancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.36,0:31:48.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这个不错
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.56,0:31:51.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] I'm just gonna drop it down on some actual grass bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.56,0:31:51.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我把它放下来 放到有草的地方试试
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.84,0:31:58.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.84,0:31:58.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.08,0:32:07.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Kaleb] What are you doing? -[Jeremy] Cultivating, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.08,0:32:06.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你们干什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.56,0:32:07.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我在耕作 兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.44,0:32:10.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Kaleb] Cultivating a margin? -[Jeremy] Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.44,0:32:10.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-耕作缓冲带？ -对
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.48,0:32:16.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Hannah's made this bird food mix, OK? -[Kale] All right, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.48,0:32:15.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}汉娜做了这种鸟食混合料
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.44,0:32:16.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-好吗？ -好的 行
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.60,0:32:20.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It means that in the winter, when their food source is very low,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.60,0:32:20.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}意思是冬天 它们的食物来源很少的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.28,0:32:23.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}they'll get to have a little bit more food in the farm than normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.28,0:32:23.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们能在农场里比平时多弄到点吃的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.64,0:32:25.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] OK, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.64,0:32:25.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-好的 所以…好的 行 -但关键是
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.00,0:32:28.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But the point is here, though, it's not gonna fuck up your cash crops
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.00,0:32:28.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这不会影响你的经济作物 所以没事
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.16,0:32:30.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-so it's all right. -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.16,0:32:31.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 这我看得出来
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.16,0:32:31.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I can see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.36,0:32:34.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That is some incredibly hard ground. Should you be doing this right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.36,0:32:34.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这地硬得离谱 你们真该现在干这事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.84,0:32:36.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Jeremy] It's doing it. -[Kaleb] I'm not saying it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.84,0:32:36.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-它在干 -对 我不是说它没在干
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.72,0:32:39.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What I'm saying is the job that it's doing is shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.72,0:32:39.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我是说它干的活儿太烂了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.80,0:32:41.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What are you on about?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.80,0:32:41.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.96,0:32:43.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] How are you gonna break that up?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.96,0:32:43.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你打算怎么把这地翻松？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.36,0:32:45.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}At the moment, you're just making craters everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.36,0:32:45.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你现在就只是在到处砸坑
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.88,0:32:49.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And what you've officially done is basically just wreck a margin.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.88,0:32:49.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你这就等于是把缓冲带毁了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.52,0:32:51.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on, you know all this now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.52,0:32:51.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}拜托 你到现在也该明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.24,0:32:55.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You've been... [sighing] Five fucking years!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.24,0:32:55.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你他妈…都五年了！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.40,0:32:58.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You just got excited and wanted to use that piece of shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.40,0:32:58.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你就是太兴奋了 就想用那破玩意儿
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.48,0:32:59.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I've just looked at your...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.48,0:32:59.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我刚才看了你的…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.80,0:33:02.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Is that side parting on purpose in your hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.80,0:33:02.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你头发边上那道是故意分出来的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.28,0:33:03.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.28,0:33:03.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得不是
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.16,0:33:06.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}He's quite yellowhammeresque, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.16,0:33:06.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-他看起来挺像黄鹀的 是吧？ -那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.12,0:33:08.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-I'd say Hitler. -[Hannah chuckling]
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.12,0:33:08.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得像希特勒
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.12,0:33:10.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Have a look at the ladies and gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.12,0:33:10.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}各位自己看看
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.40,0:33:11.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Hannah chuckling]
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.48,0:33:12.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.48,0:33:12.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.60,0:33:14.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Jeremy] It is weird. -[Kaleb] Does it look bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.60,0:33:14.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-是挺怪的 -很难看吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.00,0:33:15.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I think it looks like a yellowhammer.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.00,0:33:15.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得看起来像黄鹀
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.52,0:33:18.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}He doesn't look like a yellowhammer, he's just like a fat Hitler.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.52,0:33:18.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他才不像黄鹀 他就是个胖版希特勒
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.60,0:33:20.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[all laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.40,0:33:21.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Shut the fuck up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.40,0:33:21.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}闭上你的臭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.08,0:33:23.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[all laughing] -[Kaleb muttering]
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.48,0:33:26.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Maybe I should do like a middle parting. -Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.48,0:33:25.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}也许我该中分
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.00,0:33:25.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 行
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.80,0:33:30.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Now you look like you're from the 1920s. Now you look like Martin Bormann.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.80,0:33:30.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在你看起来像是二十年代的人了 现在你看起来像是马丁鲍曼
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.36,0:33:31.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You wanna try and look like a yellowhammer...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.36,0:33:33.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-你想看起来像黄鹀… -像天空体育台那哥们
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.88,0:33:32.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Like that Sky Sports guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.08,0:33:35.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, Martin Bormann is not a Sky Sports guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.08,0:33:35.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 马丁鲍曼不是天空体育台的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.40,0:33:36.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's Martin Brundle.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.40,0:33:36.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那是马丁布伦德尔
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.44,0:33:38.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Hannah] I think you should tuft it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.44,0:33:38.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得你应该把头发竖起来
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.56,0:33:41.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Martin Brundle and Martin Bormann are not the same people.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.56,0:33:41.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}马丁布伦德尔 和马丁鲍曼不是同一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.72,0:33:45.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  We then got back to the business of cultivating the margin,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.72,0:33:45.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后我们回到正事 继续耕作缓冲带
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.04,0:33:50.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and there was no denying that Kaleb did have a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.04,0:33:50.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但不得不承认 卡莱布说得确实有道理
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.60,0:33:52.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Jesus Christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.60,0:33:52.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.88,0:33:55.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That is like a sort of hairy paving slab.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.88,0:33:55.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这简直像长了毛的石板
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.92,0:33:58.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Yeah, so I don't think you should drill it today.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.92,0:33:58.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 所以我觉得你们今天不该播种
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.72,0:34:01.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I think you should leave it until we get some sort of moisture.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.72,0:34:01.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得你们应该等有点水分了再说
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.32,0:34:03.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I think your point is that there's no point doing it,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.32,0:34:03.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得你的意思是 现在干也没用
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.64,0:34:05.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}it will just be a waste of seed without the rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.64,0:34:05.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没下雨 撒种子也是白费
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.48,0:34:07.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.48,0:34:07.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.52,0:34:09.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There's no point doing it because it's not gonna grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.52,0:34:09.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在种也没意义 反正长不出来
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.52,0:34:16.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[soft music]
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.12,0:34:18.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  Two weeks later,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.12,0:34:21.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}两周后 我们确定 云雀雏鸟已经离巢…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.28,0:34:21.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}when we were certain the skylark chicks had flown their nest,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.48,0:34:26.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I allowed Kaleb to mow the GS4 field,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.48,0:34:26.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我允许卡莱布去割那块GS4地
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.40,0:34:30.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which to him felt like a complete waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.40,0:34:30.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但在他看来 这完全是浪费时间
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.16,0:34:32.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How dead this lot looks.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.16,0:34:32.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这一片看起来多死气沉沉啊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.04,0:34:37.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If we had done this four weeks ago, we'd have had silage,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.04,0:34:37.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}要是我们四周前割 就能有青贮饲料
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.60,0:34:40.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}therefore the nutrition in the grass is much higher,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.60,0:34:40.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}草的营养价值也高得多
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.12,0:34:42.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}for example like the sugars and so on.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.12,0:34:42.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}比如糖分什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.52,0:34:44.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So therefore, actually the cows might actually like it,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.52,0:34:44.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因此实际上 牛会更喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.84,0:34:46.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}'cause it's more palatable for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.84,0:34:46.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为适口性更好
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.68,0:34:50.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Where I think now it's gonna be like eating a bit of cardboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.68,0:34:50.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在的话 我觉得 吃起来跟嚼纸板差不多
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.72,0:34:52.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[tense music]
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.92,0:34:56.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  In the grand scheme of things, though,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.92,0:34:56.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不过 从大局来看
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.96,0:34:59.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Kaleb's silage problems were quite small.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.96,0:34:59.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}卡莱布的青贮饲料问题其实很小…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.56,0:35:04.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Because harvest was now approaching
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.56,0:35:04.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为收获季快到了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.24,0:35:07.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and I was seriously worried about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.24,0:35:07.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我真的很担心
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.56,0:35:12.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We'd had the driest spring for over a hundred years.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.56,0:35:12.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们经历了一百多年来最干旱的春天
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.92,0:35:16.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}In early summer, a drought had been formally declared.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.92,0:35:16.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}初夏的时候 官方正式宣布了旱灾
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.36,0:35:18.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（三月）
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.16,0:35:21.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And in the five months since we'd planted the spring crops
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.16,0:35:20.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}从我们种下 春季作物以来的五个月里…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.92,0:35:21.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（四月）
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.84,0:35:26.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we'd had 70% less rain than average.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.84,0:35:22.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（五月）
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.76,0:35:24.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…降雨量比平均值少了…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.52,0:35:25.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（六月）
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.48,0:35:26.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}…百分之七十
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.56,0:35:32.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Consequently, my pre-harvest crop walk with Charlie
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.56,0:35:29.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}（七月）
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.04,0:35:32.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因此 我和查理 在丰收前的例行作物巡视…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.72,0:35:35.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}was a grim affair.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.72,0:35:35.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}变成了一件很沮丧的事
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.20,0:35:39.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Jeremy] Onions and beetroots. -[Charlie] Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.20,0:35:39.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-洋葱和甜菜 -对
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.28,0:35:43.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Or, as I like to call it, no onions or beetroots.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.28,0:35:43.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}或者 我更喜欢叫它 “没有洋葱和甜菜”
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.32,0:35:46.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What the bloody hell's gone wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.32,0:35:46.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-这他妈到底哪儿出问题了？ -这个…嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.48,0:35:48.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Charlie] Well... -We planted this twice, remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.48,0:35:48.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们种了两次 记得吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.16,0:35:52.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We've given it 1.6 million onion seeds
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.16,0:35:52.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们播了一百六十万颗洋葱种子
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.84,0:35:54.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-and five have grown. -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.84,0:35:54.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-只长了五颗 -对
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.96,0:35:57.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Sorry, sorry, sorry, I'm wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.96,0:35:57.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对不起 我错了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.56,0:35:59.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Seven have grown, there's two there.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.56,0:35:59.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}长了七颗 那儿有两颗
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.84,0:36:03.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It is very disappointing, 'cause you put all that effort in.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.84,0:36:03.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}太让人失望了 你费了那么大的劲
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.12,0:36:05.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Jeremy] I know. -Well, the machine did.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.12,0:36:05.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-我知道 -是机器费的劲
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.08,0:36:08.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And I feel sad actually because the RoboDroid
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.08,0:36:08.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}其实我挺难过的 因为那个播种机器人…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.16,0:36:11.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}is a fascinating piece of equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.16,0:36:11.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-对 我是说… -…是个很了不起的设备
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.24,0:36:13.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And everyone will just go: "Well, that's rubbish."
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.24,0:36:13.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但所有人都会说“这破玩意儿”
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.68,0:36:16.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But the truth of the matter is it just hasn't rained.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.68,0:36:16.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但事实是 一直没下雨
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.80,0:36:19.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I think we've had no more than twenty mil in March, April, May
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.80,0:36:19.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得三、四、五、六月加起来
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.80,0:36:22.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-and June. -It's not even an inch.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.80,0:36:22.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}降雨量不超过20毫米
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.60,0:36:24.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-It's... -That much.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.60,0:36:24.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}连一英寸都不到 就…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.28,0:36:27.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Twenty twenty-fifths. It's four fifths of an inch.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.28,0:36:25.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就这么点
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.44,0:36:28.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}20到25毫米 也就五分之四英寸
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.16,0:36:29.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[wind blowing]
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.20,0:36:31.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  And over in the mustard field,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.20,0:36:33.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}芥菜地那边的情况也好不到哪儿去
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.56,0:36:33.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}things were no better.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.40,0:36:35.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is very, very, disappointing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.40,0:36:35.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这真的非常非常让人失望
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.60,0:36:38.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Charlie] It's a bit of a desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.60,0:36:38.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}有点像沙漠了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.24,0:36:43.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And the issue is you've got a commercial need for mustard,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.24,0:36:43.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}问题是 你对芥末有商业需求
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.08,0:36:45.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which is one of the biggest sellers in the shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.08,0:36:45.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它是店里卖得最好的商品之一
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.24,0:36:46.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It is the biggest.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.24,0:36:46.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是卖得最好的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.80,0:36:48.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.80,0:36:48.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}操
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.00,0:36:53.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  Charlie was just as downbeat in the wheat fields.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.00,0:36:53.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}查理在小麦地里也同样悲观
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.00,0:36:56.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Charlie] You can see that the crop is much thinner than it usually is.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.00,0:36:56.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你能看到庄稼比平时稀薄得多
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.40,0:36:59.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There's a lot more light got in, you've got some pretty small heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.40,0:36:59.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}透进去的光多很多 麦穗也小得可怜
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.92,0:37:02.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That is one ear of wheat.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.92,0:37:02.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是一个麦穗
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.08,0:37:05.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The grains are quite shrivelled and look a bit rubbish.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.08,0:37:05.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}麦粒很干瘪 看起来有点垃圾
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.32,0:37:11.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  And even I could see that the barley wasn't much good either.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.32,0:37:11.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就连我都能看出来大麦也不怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.08,0:37:14.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[sighing]
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.20,0:37:16.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's just not tall enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.20,0:37:16.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就是不够高
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.60,0:37:20.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's six inches below where it should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.60,0:37:20.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}比正常矮了15厘米
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.96,0:37:21.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.96,0:37:21.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我的意思是…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.04,0:37:27.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}if Russell Crowe walked through this, he'd have to have arms like a chimpanzee
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.04,0:37:27.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}要是罗素克劳从这地里走过 他得长一双黑猩猩那么长的手臂
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.08,0:37:30.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to be able to drag his fingers through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.08,0:37:30.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}才能让手指头碰到麦穗
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.28,0:37:35.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  I then dug out a clip I'd posted back in 2019,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.28,0:37:35.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后我翻出了 一段2019年发的视频
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.32,0:37:38.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and that rammed home the point even harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.32,0:37:38.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这就更能说明问题了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.12,0:37:41.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is from...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.12,0:37:43.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是五年前的六月
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.40,0:37:43.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}June five years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.76,0:37:46.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And look at the barley then.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.76,0:37:46.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你看那时候的大麦
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.80,0:37:49.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look how much taller it is, it hadn't even ripened,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.80,0:37:49.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它比现在高多了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.60,0:37:52.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}than it is now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.60,0:37:52.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而且都还没熟
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.24,0:37:53.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy on video]  Marcus Aurelius.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.24,0:37:53.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}马库斯奥雷利乌斯
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.08,0:37:55.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[sad music]
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.56,0:38:00.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  Nevertheless, we'd still have to do the harvest,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.56,0:38:00.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}尽管如此 我们还是得收割
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.92,0:38:04.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which meant decluttering and cleaning all the storage sheds
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.92,0:38:04.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这意味着要把所有仓库清理干净
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.52,0:38:07.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}so they were ready to receive the grain.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.52,0:38:07.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}准备好接收粮食
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.20,0:38:09.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-We've gotta get all this out. -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.20,0:38:09.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-这些都得弄出去 -对
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.40,0:38:12.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] Wow! Wow! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.40,0:38:12.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}停！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.80,0:38:14.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Lisa] OK, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.80,0:38:14.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了 不错
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.32,0:38:15.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[telehandler beeping]
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.16,0:38:19.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[sad music continues]
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.28,0:38:30.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  After the storage areas were tidied and prepped,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.28,0:38:30.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}仓库区域清理准备完毕后
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.36,0:38:34.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I asked Charlie and Kaleb to come to the office for a chat.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.36,0:38:34.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我让查理和卡莱布来办公室聊聊
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.48,0:38:38.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right, come on you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.48,0:38:38.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了 来吧 你们俩
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.80,0:38:43.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Harvest... -Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.80,0:38:43.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-丰收 -对
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.56,0:38:44.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"Harveest".
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.56,0:38:44.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}丰收
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.64,0:38:45.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's upon us.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.64,0:38:45.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它来了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.24,0:38:48.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I know, but I need some dates.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.24,0:38:48.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道 但我需要具体日期
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.96,0:38:51.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}'Cause last year, it was a bit disorganised
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.96,0:38:51.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为去年有点乱
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.72,0:38:54.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and we had a falling out, I don't want that to happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.72,0:38:54.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们当时还闹翻了 我不想再发生那种事
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.20,0:38:55.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Kaleb] You were stressed. -I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.20,0:38:55.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你当时压力太大了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.12,0:38:58.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Trying to open the pub was... But I think this year...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.12,0:38:57.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 又要忙开酒吧的事…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.40,0:38:58.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但我觉得今年…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.64,0:39:01.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy sighing]
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.96,0:39:03.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Erm...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.68,0:39:07.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Charlie] I think it's very clear. Oats next week.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.68,0:39:07.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得很清楚 下周割燕麦
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.64,0:39:09.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I think the wheats will be ready
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.64,0:39:12.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}小麦大概再下周就能收了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.88,0:39:12.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}probably the week after.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.84,0:39:14.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Say, Monday the 28th.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.84,0:39:14.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就说28号周一吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.24,0:39:17.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Or end of July basically. -[Charlie] Or end of July.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.24,0:39:17.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-所以基本都在七月底 -都在七月底
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.00,0:39:20.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Kaleb] Why, you going away? -Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.00,0:39:20.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-怎么 你要出门？ -操
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.84,0:39:21.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.84,0:39:21.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.64,0:39:25.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I've got cancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.64,0:39:25.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我得了癌症
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.16,0:39:30.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] No.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.16,0:39:30.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.88,0:39:32.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.88,0:39:32.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}得了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.96,0:39:39.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] You haven't.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.96,0:39:39.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 你没得病
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.04,0:39:42.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.04,0:39:42.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.32,0:39:46.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Where is of no concern of anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.32,0:39:46.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}具体部位就不劳大家操心了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.04,0:39:49.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I've known since May.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.04,0:39:49.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我五月份就知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.64,0:39:54.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I had a medical. You remember, back in May?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.64,0:39:54.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我做了个身体检查 记得吗 五月份？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.68,0:39:56.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Kaleb] Yeah, yeah. -And they went, eew..
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.68,0:39:56.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-对 -然后他们说：“哦”
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.24,0:39:58.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You know, I disappeared off the other week and I had a biopsy,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.24,0:39:58.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后 前几周 我消失了一下
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.52,0:40:01.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and it is cancer, and it's aggressive, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.52,0:40:01.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}又去做了一次活检 是癌症 而且进展很快
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.92,0:40:05.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's really early, so the treatment will be, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.92,0:40:05.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但发现得特别早 所以治疗方案嘛 你们知道…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.28,0:40:08.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm praying that we can get the harvest done
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.28,0:40:08.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我是说 我祈祷我们能先把收割干完
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.84,0:40:10.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and then I could go and get some treatment,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.84,0:40:10.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后我再去接受治疗
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.56,0:40:14.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but it's gonna be slap bang in the middle...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.56,0:40:14.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但时间刚好卡在正中间
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.20,0:40:18.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Look after yourself I would... -Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.20,0:40:18.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-保重身体 -对
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.24,0:40:19.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You go and do...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.24,0:40:19.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你该去…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.36,0:40:22.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, I know, I mean, listen, I'm not that daft.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.36,0:40:22.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 我是说 听着 我没那么傻
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.16,0:40:26.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So, it's going to be in about two weeks, maybe three.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.16,0:40:26.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那么大概两周后 也许三周
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.92,0:40:29.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'll have to go and have an operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.92,0:40:29.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我得去做个手术
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.12,0:40:31.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.12,0:40:31.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.68,0:40:33.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and then...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.68,0:40:33.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.12,0:40:35.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Erm...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.16,0:40:36.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Will you stay away or are you coming back after?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.16,0:40:36.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你会休息一段时间 还是做完就回来？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.96,0:40:39.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, no, the operation's in and out in no time,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.96,0:40:39.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 手术很快 进去就出来
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.24,0:40:42.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but then you're slightly out of action for a little while.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.24,0:40:42.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但之后有段时间会行动有点不便
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.08,0:40:46.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But in the meantime, Simon, the combine man, has retired.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.08,0:40:46.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不过与此同时 开联合收割机的西蒙退休了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.48,0:40:49.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So you were going to do the combining this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.48,0:40:49.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 你今年得自己开收割机了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.04,0:40:52.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-And I was going to do the grain carting. -[Kaleb] Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.04,0:40:52.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-我本来打算开运粮车的 -对
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.28,0:40:55.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But it now looks likely I won't be able to do the grain carting.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.28,0:40:55.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但现在看来我可能开不了运粮车了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.24,0:40:57.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So we're gonna have to get Lisa trained up.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.24,0:40:57.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 我们得把丽莎培训出来
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.28,0:40:58.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Yeah. -Lisa can drive a tractor.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.28,0:40:58.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.20,0:41:00.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}She's perfectly capable of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.20,0:41:00.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}丽莎会开拖拉机 她完全有能力
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.76,0:41:03.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And if you load stationary, which only adds, what, two minutes...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.76,0:41:03.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而且如果你是静态装车的话 我知道那只会多花两分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.40,0:41:07.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, she'd probably be good enough to do it on the move, honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.40,0:41:07.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}她可能也能在行进间操作 我不确定
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.88,0:41:10.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, I just wish you a very, very speedy recovery.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.88,0:41:10.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我只想祝你早日康复
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.16,0:41:13.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Well, I thank you. I promise I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.16,0:41:13.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}谢谢 我会的…我保证我会没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.72,0:41:15.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-If you need anything, you just ring me. -[Jeremy] Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.72,0:41:15.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-你需要什么 就给我打电话 -好
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.68,0:41:18.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[sighing]
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.00,0:41:20.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Pisser, though, innit?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.00,0:41:20.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但真倒霉 是吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.48,0:41:25.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.48,0:41:26.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-我不喜欢这种情况 -不
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.36,0:41:26.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.88,0:41:28.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I wasn't thrilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.88,0:41:28.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我很不好受
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.72,0:41:31.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, but I wasn't prepared for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.72,0:41:31.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道 但我没准备好面对这事
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.32,0:41:42.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  Mercifully, in farming,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.32,0:41:46.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}谢天谢地 干农活这行 你永远没时间纠结个人问题
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.96,0:41:45.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}you don't ever have time to dwell on personal matters,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.08,0:41:48.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}'cause there's always something to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.08,0:41:48.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为总有事情要做
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.84,0:41:51.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And the thing I had to do the following day
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.84,0:41:51.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而我第二天要做的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.48,0:41:55.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}was put the cows through their six-monthly test for TB,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.48,0:41:55.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是给牛做半年一次的结核病检测
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.04,0:41:59.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}along with an ever-shrinking Dilwyn.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.04,0:41:59.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}顺便见见越来越瘦的迪尔翁
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.48,0:42:02.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Dilwyn] Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.48,0:42:02.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.52,0:42:04.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Strewth, mate...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.52,0:42:04.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天哪 哥们
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.16,0:42:06.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah! Yeah, you're coming along as well, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.16,0:42:06.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 你也瘦了 是吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.60,0:42:08.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Well, not much. Not like that. -[Dilwyn] No.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.60,0:42:08.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-嗯 不多 没那么夸张 -对 不
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.92,0:42:11.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But I've been at it for longer than you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.92,0:42:11.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不过我坚持得比你久
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.20,0:42:15.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, I mean, you are literally an advertisement for fat jabs.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.20,0:42:15.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 我是说 你简直就是减肥针的活广告
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.08,0:42:16.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes, possibly.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.08,0:42:16.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 可能吧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.68,0:42:20.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So, all bar one are pregnant again, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.68,0:42:20.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 除了一头 其他又都怀上了 是吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.08,0:42:22.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Dilwyn] Yeah, you've got six of them pregnant
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.08,0:42:24.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 你这里在大概35天内 有六头牛怀了孕
