Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.40,0:42:26.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Jeremy] Endgame's a busy boy. -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.40,0:42:26.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-终局真是个忙活的小伙子 -对
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.96,0:42:29.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] These calves are fantastic, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.96,0:42:29.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这些小牛真棒 是吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.08,0:42:30.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Dilwyn] They're good-looking calves, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.08,0:42:30.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们长得挺好看 是吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.76,0:42:33.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That one is a bit under the weather,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.76,0:42:33.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那头有点不舒服 所以我刚检查了一下
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.08,0:42:35.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}so I've just checked him out. He's got a touch of pneumonia.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.08,0:42:35.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-它有点肺炎的症状 -是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.64,0:42:36.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Jeremy] Has he? Oh no! -Sad, but hopefully he should be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.64,0:42:36.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-对 -不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.92,0:42:40.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Jeremy] That one looks a bit peaky. -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.92,0:42:39.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以…但希望它应该没事
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.00,0:42:40.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-它看起来是有点病恹恹的 那头 -对
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.92,0:42:43.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Kaleb's bringing some hay down. -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.92,0:42:43.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-卡莱布正送干草过来 -对
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.16,0:42:45.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Here he comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.16,0:42:45.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他来了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.56,0:42:47.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[mooing] -[Dilwyn] That's dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.56,0:42:47.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}开饭了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.92,0:42:51.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] They are excited by that. They can smell it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.92,0:42:50.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-它们激动坏了 -对
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.32,0:42:51.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们能闻到
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.56,0:42:54.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}All right, come on, let's get 'em in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.56,0:42:54.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了 来吧 把它们赶进来
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.28,0:42:55.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Dilwyn] Yeah, come on then.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.28,0:42:55.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.76,0:42:57.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  The actual TB test
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.76,0:43:01.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}结核病检测其实就是 由迪尔翁去测量牛脖子上的肿块
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.76,0:43:01.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}involves Dilwyn measuring lumps in the cow's necks.
