Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.00,0:43:04.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Hang on. Seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.00,0:43:04.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}等一下 七号
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.60,0:43:08.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy]  But what you really hope for is no lumps at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.60,0:43:08.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但你真正希望的是 一点肿块都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.88,0:43:10.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Dilwyn] No lumps. -[Jeremy] Clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.88,0:43:10.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-没肿块 -干净？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.36,0:43:12.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Dilwyn] Yeah. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.36,0:43:12.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.08,0:43:13.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Off you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.08,0:43:13.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.20,0:43:15.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hay time.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.20,0:43:15.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}吃草时间
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.28,0:43:19.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh yeah, look at that! "I'm gonna wear my food."
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.28,0:43:19.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 你看 “我要把食物穿在身上”
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.96,0:43:25.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Good news? -Good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.96,0:43:25.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-好消息？ -好消息
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.96,0:43:27.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] That's what I like to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.96,0:43:27.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这我爱听
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.44,0:43:31.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.44,0:43:31.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.16,0:43:34.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Are you not actually measuring them?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.16,0:43:34.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你难道不用量吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.88,0:43:36.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There's nothing to measure.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.88,0:43:36.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 没什么可量的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.52,0:43:39.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I thought you'd have those little tweezer things.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.52,0:43:39.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}明白了 我还以为你会有那种小卡尺
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.40,0:43:40.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.40,0:43:40.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我有
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.64,0:43:42.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But I only measure them when there's lumps.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.64,0:43:42.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但我只在有肿块的时候才量
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.40,0:43:44.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Jeremy] And there's no lumps? -There's no lumps.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.40,0:43:44.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-所以没肿块？ -没肿块
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.28,0:43:46.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Oh, so she's all right. -[Dilwyn] She's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.28,0:43:46.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-所以它没事…它没事 -它没事
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.88,0:43:48.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Jeremy] That's number eleven. -[Dilwyn] Yeah, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.88,0:43:48.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-这是11号 -对 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.80,0:43:56.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}All right, callipers.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.80,0:43:56.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了 卡尺
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.28,0:43:57.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] You what?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.28,0:43:57.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.88,0:44:00.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-[Dilwyn] Lumps. -[Jeremy] You've got... This one's got...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.88,0:43:58.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}肿块
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.96,0:44:00.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这头有…这头有…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.12,0:44:04.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Dilwyn] Good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.12,0:44:05.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好姑娘 好了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.68,0:44:05.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}All right.
