Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.96,0:44:14.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}She's got two lumps the same size.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.96,0:44:14.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它有两个一样大的肿块
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.44,0:44:16.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So, all right, I'll just measure,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.44,0:44:16.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 我来量一下
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.36,0:44:19.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'll just check to see what her measurements was last time.
