Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.24,0:44:22.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right, so last time the top one was eleven
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.24,0:44:22.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了 上次上面那个是11
