Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.64,0:44:46.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-上面那个增加了一 -对
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.56,0:44:48.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. And the bottom one's gone up two.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.56,0:44:48.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}下面那个增加了二
