Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.76,0:44:50.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}迪尔翁 我不喜欢这个情况
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.88,0:44:52.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Dilwyn] And then if you go down to this, that's a plus one,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.88,0:44:52.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后你对照这个
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.92,0:44:56.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}that's a plus two,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.92,0:44:56.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这里是加一 这里是加二
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.00,0:44:59.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}so it's that square there, which is the green.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.00,0:44:59.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以是那个格子绿色的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.04,0:45:01.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-It's green. -It's green.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.04,0:45:01.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-是绿色 -是绿色
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.64,0:45:04.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Dilwyn] Pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.64,0:45:04.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}通过
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.08,0:45:06.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If that had been one millimetre more,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.08,0:45:06.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果再增加一毫米
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.52,0:45:09.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}then we'd have failed her on the bovine,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.52,0:45:10.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这头牛就不过关了 但它没有
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.16,0:45:10.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but she didn't.
