Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.44,0:45:11.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}真够悬的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.12,0:45:14.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That is shit-a-brick time.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.12,0:45:14.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那真是要吓死人了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.64,0:45:16.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-Well, it was. -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.64,0:45:16.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-嗯 确实是 -对
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.12,0:45:17.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Luckily,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.12,0:45:19.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}幸运的是 你通过了 但只是勉强
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.64,0:45:20.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}you passed but only just.
