Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.84,0:45:25.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Kaleb] Go on then.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.84,0:45:25.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那继续吧
