Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.24,0:45:29.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}下一头牛 迪尔翁 又需要他的测量工具了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.08,0:45:31.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}[Jeremy] Have you got the chart out again, Dilwyn?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.08,0:45:32.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-迪尔翁 你又把图表拿出来了？ -对
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.72,0:45:32.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.04,0:45:34.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh shit.
