Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.04,0:45:38.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So she's passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.04,0:45:38.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它通过了
